(1141265, 141892, 22384, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. The stark contrast of the brilliant white and the pitch black trick my brain into thinking that the light is almost to bright to look at. I like the simplicity.</td>', 'Cool shot. The stark contrast of the brilliant white and the pitch black trick my brain into thinking that the light is almost to bright to look at. I like the simplicity.', '2005-01-31 00:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
