(1141272, 140929, 22384, '<td valign="top">The beauty of the human form shot well is always breathtaking. Stunning shot, beautiful line.</td>', 'The beauty of the human form shot well is always breathtaking. Stunning shot, beautiful line.', '2005-01-31 00:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141277, 141222, 31213, '<td valign="top">Visually I find this a little complicated.  There is no solid focal point for your eye to find.  All the droplets are in focus, which is good, but its missing the "umph" of a subject.  Also, the reflection is something, but we can''t tell what it is.  If the reflection made more sense, or didn''t exist at all, it''d be a strong photograph in my opinion.  Nice job though.</td>', 'Visually I find this a little complicated.  There is no solid focal point for your eye to find.  All the droplets are in focus, which is good, but its missing the "umph" of a subject.  Also, the reflection is something, but we can''t tell what it is.  If the reflection made more sense, or didn''t exist at all, it''d be a strong photograph in my opinion.  Nice job though.', '2005-01-31 00:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141281, 141439, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stunning use of grayscale. Elegant line and beautiful in its simplicity. Great work.</td>', 'Stunning use of grayscale. Elegant line and beautiful in its simplicity. Great work.', '2005-01-31 00:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
