(1141297, 141508, 22384, '<td valign="top">Brilliant Idea. I would like the blown out section to be a toned down a bit. Just a personal bias: I would have cloned out the armpit hair. Not that I have anything against armpit hair, but it distracts from the beautiful line of this image. Again, IMO the concept is genius.</td>', 'Brilliant Idea. I would like the blown out section to be a toned down a bit. Just a personal bias: I would have cloned out the armpit hair. Not that I have anything against armpit hair, but it distracts from the beautiful line of this image. Again, IMO the concept is genius.', '2005-01-31 00:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
