(1141526, 141608, 30861, '<td valign="top">This image is in many ways very effective, but the haloing from sharpening is a major distraction for me, and the pure red seems overstated, it is almost at the level of trickery. Had you left a hint of color int he foreground, I''d have liked it better.</td>', 'This image is in many ways very effective, but the haloing from sharpening is a major distraction for me, and the pure red seems overstated, it is almost at the level of trickery. Had you left a hint of color int he foreground, I''d have liked it better.', '2005-01-31 02:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
