(1141548, 141386, 28619, '<td valign="top">I think this will suffer because of the link to the challenge.  I know it said any interpretation of a light, but I think this will get marked down because it is a picture of a big light and not a subtle or novel interpretation.<br/> <br/>As for the photo itself, I would like to see it rotated a fraction so the light is vertical and the horizon level.  The background and foreground are both a little dull and the whole thing looks a bit lifeless to me.<br/> <br/>I would have like to have seen this taken at dusk on a day with a beautiful sky and the lighthouse operating.  I think that would have scored much higher.</td>', 'I think this will suffer because of the link to the challenge.  I know it said any interpretation of a light, but I think this will get marked down because it is a picture of a big light and not a subtle or novel interpretation. As for the photo itself, I would like to see it rotated a fraction so the light is vertical and the horizon level.  The background and foreground are both a little dull and the whole thing looks a bit lifeless to me. I would have like to have seen this taken at dusk on a day with a beautiful sky and the lighthouse operating.  I think that would have scored much higher.', '2005-01-31 02:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
