(1141705, 141829, 31511, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen and taken many photographs of rainbows, but this must be among the very best. That cathedral spire really makes it! And the tile roofs anchoring the base add weight to a lovely shot.</td>', 'I''ve seen and taken many photographs of rainbows, but this must be among the very best. That cathedral spire really makes it! And the tile roofs anchoring the base add weight to a lovely shot.', '2005-01-31 05:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
