(1142557, 141699, 26475, '<td valign="top">having a colored border rarely helps a photo. In this case, since there''s already a lot of yellow, I would have used black. I think it would also be better if you tried to remove some of the yellow, as your camera was apperenlty on the wrong exposure setting. Unless the walls really were yellow....</td>', 'having a colored border rarely helps a photo. In this case, since there''s already a lot of yellow, I would have used black. I think it would also be better if you tried to remove some of the yellow, as your camera was apperenlty on the wrong exposure setting. Unless the walls really were yellow....', '2005-01-31 15:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142565, 141513, 28108, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but I don''t like the tilt.</td>', 'Beautiful, but I don''t like the tilt.', '2005-01-31 15:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142569, 141901, 8970, '<td valign="top">The upper portion looks a little bizzare, don''t think that sharp change was needed</td>', 'The upper portion looks a little bizzare, don''t think that sharp change was needed', '2005-01-31 15:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142570, 141466, 28108, '<td valign="top">Yikes! Wouldn''t wanna run into this guy late at night in a dark alley... Spooky! The more you look at it tough... There''s a certain kindness... Well done...</td>', 'Yikes! Wouldn''t wanna run into this guy late at night in a dark alley... Spooky! The more you look at it tough... There''s a certain kindness... Well done...', '2005-01-31 15:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142571, 141760, 28108, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract!</td>', 'Nice abstract!', '2005-01-31 15:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142576, 141212, 31214, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and a nice mood created here.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and a nice mood created here.', '2005-01-31 15:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142596, 141441, 31214, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve cropped this.  The town is bathed in the sky!</td>', 'I like the way you''ve cropped this.  The town is bathed in the sky!', '2005-01-31 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142600, 141500, 20679, '<td valign="top">You have achieved extraordinary tonality in this shot and managed to control all the shadows and highlights with great skill.</td>', 'You have achieved extraordinary tonality in this shot and managed to control all the shadows and highlights with great skill.', '2005-01-31 15:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142614, 139620, 16000, '<td valign="top">...and the light itself is different.</td>', '...and the light itself is different.', '2005-01-31 15:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142617, 141793, 16000, '<td valign="top">...good lighting, needs a bit more DOF in upper left corner.</td>', '...good lighting, needs a bit more DOF in upper left corner.', '2005-01-31 15:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142620, 140323, 16000, '<td valign="top">feels like it is OOF to me.  Or perhaps hand held at slow speed.</td>', 'feels like it is OOF to me.  Or perhaps hand held at slow speed.', '2005-01-31 15:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142621, 141759, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I think however that if the image had been a little darker and deeper, it might have had more impact.</td>', 'Very nice. I think however that if the image had been a little darker and deeper, it might have had more impact.', '2005-01-31 15:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142622, 141826, 16000, '<td valign="top">great background and lighting.  this is one of the best i have seen so far.</td>', 'great background and lighting.  this is one of the best i have seen so far.', '2005-01-31 15:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142625, 141676, 8643, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!</td>', 'Brilliant!', '2005-01-31 15:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142627, 141003, 16000, '<td valign="top">...to bad you are missing something for all that light to shine onto.  still a nice exercise in lighting.</td>', '...to bad you are missing something for all that light to shine onto.  still a nice exercise in lighting.', '2005-01-31 15:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142629, 141670, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very moody..I''m not sure about the aspect ratio though; I think a tighter crop horizontally might enhance this image.</td>', 'Very moody..I''m not sure about the aspect ratio though; I think a tighter crop horizontally might enhance this image.', '2005-01-31 16:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142632, 141391, 5286, '<td valign="top">Good attempt. But a couple of things would help a lot. Firstly, the focus needs to be shaper. Second, the horizontal red/yellow line is not really horizontal, nor is the vertical one vertical. This is a little distracting. Finally, the harsh shadows do not do much for the image- I think it would be a lot cleaner without those harsh shadows.</td>', 'Good attempt. But a couple of things would help a lot. Firstly, the focus needs to be shaper. Second, the horizontal red/yellow line is not really horizontal, nor is the vertical one vertical. This is a little distracting. Finally, the harsh shadows do not do much for the image- I think it would be a lot cleaner without those harsh shadows.', '2005-01-31 16:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142642, 140387, 5286, '<td valign="top">Since the subject is presumably the flame, the focus on it could have been sharper. Using a deeper DOF would probably work better for this image, also reducing the exposure for more detail on the flame. <br/></td>', 'Since the subject is presumably the flame, the focus on it could have been sharper. Using a deeper DOF would probably work better for this image, also reducing the exposure for more detail on the flame. ', '2005-01-31 16:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142643, 139881, 5286, '<td valign="top">OOF.</td>', 'OOF.', '2005-01-31 16:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142646, 141201, 5286, '<td valign="top">Extremely well done. 10!</td>', 'Extremely well done. 10!', '2005-01-31 16:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142647, 141900, 20679, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selected desaturation, and the shadows are also great. Perhaps slightly less keen on the crop though</td>', 'Nice use of selected desaturation, and the shadows are also great. Perhaps slightly less keen on the crop though', '2005-01-31 16:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142654, 141895, 18349, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I can even begin to describe how beautiful this image is.  What a creative, soulful, and emotive image.  10</td>', 'I don''t think I can even begin to describe how beautiful this image is.  What a creative, soulful, and emotive image.  10', '2005-01-31 16:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142655, 141044, 20679, '<td valign="top">Not sure how you did this, but it''s neat</td>', 'Not sure how you did this, but it''s neat', '2005-01-31 16:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142685, 141787, 10080, '<td valign="top">all around awesome! should ribbon! Great job 10.</td>', 'all around awesome! should ribbon! Great job 10.', '2005-01-31 16:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142687, 141518, 10080, '<td valign="top">Awesome portrait! Love the lighting 10</td>', 'Awesome portrait! Love the lighting 10', '2005-01-31 16:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142691, 141609, 10080, '<td valign="top">Its a wonderful idea, I just think that it may have worked better with a little more drama. 7</td>', 'Its a wonderful idea, I just think that it may have worked better with a little more drama. 7', '2005-01-31 16:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142693, 141781, 19040, '<td valign="top">Nice color, I light how it''s back lit.</td>', 'Nice color, I light how it''s back lit.', '2005-01-31 16:37:15.000000', NULL, 1);
