(1142832, 141034, 12809, '<td valign="top">At a first quick glance the bg looks solid black but after closer inspection there are faint colored spots scattered throughout.  I would prefer a solic bg.  I like the flower and the water droplets but I''m not sure about the white stem.</td>', 'At a first quick glance the bg looks solid black but after closer inspection there are faint colored spots scattered throughout.  I would prefer a solic bg.  I like the flower and the water droplets but I''m not sure about the white stem.', '2005-01-31 17:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
