(1142850, 141890, 20679, '<td valign="top">Wow...that is a clever effect! I hope enough people read the title and actually do what it says. Photographically it''s not that interesting and will probably be clobbered, but it is interesting and innovative none the less!</td>', 'Wow...that is a clever effect! I hope enough people read the title and actually do what it says. Photographically it''s not that interesting and will probably be clobbered, but it is interesting and innovative none the less!', '2005-01-31 18:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
