(1142910, 141817, 255, '<td valign="top">So, let go, let go...<br/>Jump in<br/>Oh well, what you waiting for? :)<br/> <br/>is this a fountain? the colors and depth to this shot are gorgeous. the water  looks so...thick....like you could reach out and scoop up gobs of it.  very nice. :)<br/></td>', 'So, let go, let go...Jump inOh well, what you waiting for? :) is this a fountain? the colors and depth to this shot are gorgeous. the water  looks so...thick....like you could reach out and scoop up gobs of it.  very nice. :)', '2005-01-31 18:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142932, 141116, 19474, '<td valign="top">cool look..... do you alway microwave your cds :)</td>', 'cool look..... do you alway microwave your cds :)', '2005-01-31 19:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142936, 141829, 5286, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture, neatly composed. I really like it a lot :)</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture, neatly composed. I really like it a lot :)', '2005-01-31 19:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142940, 141608, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning photograph.  The only thing that kept me from giving it a 10 was the red light.  It would have been so beautiful in all b&amp;w and, in my opinion, would still meet the challenge.  The focus is just wonderful, as is the composition.</td>', 'This is a stunning photograph.  The only thing that kept me from giving it a 10 was the red light.  It would have been so beautiful in all b&w and, in my opinion, would still meet the challenge.  The focus is just wonderful, as is the composition.', '2005-01-31 19:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142966, 141230, 19474, '<td valign="top">I see you have had the same problem as I had , trying to get red lit objects to focus in low light photos (more edge definition of red lit objects than focus) you would have had better luck with green or blue<br/>that aside I like this photo,<br/>nice curves and lighting levels  + 7</td>', 'I see you have had the same problem as I had , trying to get red lit objects to focus in low light photos (more edge definition of red lit objects than focus) you would have had better luck with green or bluethat aside I like this photo,nice curves and lighting levels  + 7', '2005-01-31 19:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142970, 141787, 14735, '<td valign="top">Very nice light, very pleasing photo</td>', 'Very nice light, very pleasing photo', '2005-01-31 19:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142988, 141687, 14735, '<td valign="top">This.....is good</td>', 'This.....is good', '2005-01-31 19:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142996, 140012, 20941, '<td valign="top">a beautifully composed image with excellent use of light,</td>', 'a beautifully composed image with excellent use of light,', '2005-01-31 19:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142999, 141087, 24065, '<td valign="top">I am very impressed with the creative thinking behind this photo.  The colors are wonderful.  I''ve looked at it for a long time and just think the feather needed more light on it (no pun intended).  Since this was advanced editing, using the dodge tool would have really given this photo the pop it needed.  That being said, I''ve never ribboned - so don''t take my comment too seriously!  ;-)  It''s just an opinion that I hope will prove helpful.</td>', 'I am very impressed with the creative thinking behind this photo.  The colors are wonderful.  I''ve looked at it for a long time and just think the feather needed more light on it (no pun intended).  Since this was advanced editing, using the dodge tool would have really given this photo the pop it needed.  That being said, I''ve never ribboned - so don''t take my comment too seriously!  ;-)  It''s just an opinion that I hope will prove helpful.', '2005-01-31 19:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143012, 141794, 20941, '<td valign="top">beautiful subject and composition wonderfully presented with your use of lighting.</td>', 'beautiful subject and composition wonderfully presented with your use of lighting.', '2005-01-31 19:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143015, 141809, 24065, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love the reflection -- did you use shiny vinyl as a backdrop?</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love the reflection -- did you use shiny vinyl as a backdrop?', '2005-01-31 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143025, 140523, 20941, '<td valign="top">Absolutly beautiful! Great demonstration of lighting!</td>', 'Absolutly beautiful! Great demonstration of lighting!', '2005-01-31 19:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143031, 141784, 24065, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great capture!  And I love the way the limbs go diagonally across the photo.  My only suggestion would be to place the owl (?) by the rule of thirds on the upper right.  I know that''s just a guideline, but I really think it would have strengthened the composition.  That being said, I''ve never ribboned, so I wouldn''t take my advice too seriously ;-)  just an opinion that I hope will prove useful.</td>', 'Wow!  Great capture!  And I love the way the limbs go diagonally across the photo.  My only suggestion would be to place the owl (?) by the rule of thirds on the upper right.  I know that''s just a guideline, but I really think it would have strengthened the composition.  That being said, I''ve never ribboned, so I wouldn''t take my advice too seriously ;-)  just an opinion that I hope will prove useful.', '2005-01-31 19:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143050, 141899, 24065, '<td valign="top">Very creative thinking.  I''m not really sure what I think about it right now, but I promise I''ll come back and look at it again before the challenge is over.  ;-)</td>', 'Very creative thinking.  I''m not really sure what I think about it right now, but I promise I''ll come back and look at it again before the challenge is over.  ;-)', '2005-01-31 19:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
