(1143182, 141386, 12809, '<td valign="top">Pretty lighthouse.  I wish there was a bit more breathing room above the lighthouse.  It also seems to have a slight tilt to the left.  Very pretty though.</td>', 'Pretty lighthouse.  I wish there was a bit more breathing room above the lighthouse.  It also seems to have a slight tilt to the left.  Very pretty though.', '2005-01-31 19:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
