(1143189, 140315, 12809, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and comp.  I wish we could see the feather in midair/in the wind though.  I could be wrong but it seems obvious to me that someone is holding the feather just outside the frame.  The bottom of the feather shows motion from your breath but the top is motionless...therefore telling me this wasn''t actually a ''feather in the wind''.  It would be harder to capture but I think it would work better and convey your title better.  This is still a great shot though.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like the idea and comp.  I wish we could see the feather in midair/in the wind though.  I could be wrong but it seems obvious to me that someone is holding the feather just outside the frame.  The bottom of the feather shows motion from your breath but the top is motionless...therefore telling me this wasn''t actually a ''feather in the wind''.  It would be harder to capture but I think it would work better and convey your title better.  This is still a great shot though.  Nice job.', '2005-01-31 20:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
