(1143753, 141876, 14476, '<td valign="top">Liked the painting with light creation you did, including the smiling face. I know it''s technically not easy.   I do wonder if it would have been even more effective if you had used a less busy background.  Everything is in good focus though (and I wish my bedroom looked that neat).</td>', 'Liked the painting with light creation you did, including the smiling face. I know it''s technically not easy.   I do wonder if it would have been even more effective if you had used a less busy background.  Everything is in good focus though (and I wish my bedroom looked that neat).', '2005-02-01 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143757, 139697, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is so close to being a winner.  Love the colors and the light play on the mountains and water.  That''s beautiful.  The rooflines in the foreground are, to me, just a little of a distraction.  I hope you have another sunset this good and can move away from civilization a bit for another try at this.  It really is a superior view.</td>', 'This is so close to being a winner.  Love the colors and the light play on the mountains and water.  That''s beautiful.  The rooflines in the foreground are, to me, just a little of a distraction.  I hope you have another sunset this good and can move away from civilization a bit for another try at this.  It really is a superior view.', '2005-02-01 01:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143763, 141704, 14476, '<td valign="top">This looks like the interior of a covered bridge.  Great structures and certainly made to last.  You captured the woodwork beautifully.  I know you wanted to emphasize the brightly lit end of the bridge, but perhaps a neutral density filter or even a polarizer might have helped cut the glare a bit.  Still, a good effort.</td>', 'This looks like the interior of a covered bridge.  Great structures and certainly made to last.  You captured the woodwork beautifully.  I know you wanted to emphasize the brightly lit end of the bridge, but perhaps a neutral density filter or even a polarizer might have helped cut the glare a bit.  Still, a good effort.', '2005-02-01 01:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
