(1144137, 141794, 18349, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and sharp angles in this image.  The red, black, and light colors go so well together too!  I hope the bright highlights don''t get downvoted by the masses, because they add the "light" appeal to the shot.  Excellent find!  :o)</td>', 'I love the composition and sharp angles in this image.  The red, black, and light colors go so well together too!  I hope the bright highlights don''t get downvoted by the masses, because they add the "light" appeal to the shot.  Excellent find!  :o)', '2005-02-01 09:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144145, 141893, 24183, '<td valign="top">I think that is lite.  Still an excellent photo.</td>', 'I think that is lite.  Still an excellent photo.', '2005-02-01 09:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
