(1144254, 141766, 14735, '<td valign="top">Looks like you are on the edge of a forest fire</td>', 'Looks like you are on the edge of a forest fire', '2005-02-01 11:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144259, 141260, 14735, '<td valign="top">Looks like the square when I do my Gamma adjustments. I really like this very well balanced and good color combination</td>', 'Looks like the square when I do my Gamma adjustments. I really like this very well balanced and good color combination', '2005-02-01 11:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144265, 139612, 14735, '<td valign="top">I thin I see the man in the golf ball. Get it. Real or photshopped I like the glare</td>', 'I thin I see the man in the golf ball. Get it. Real or photshopped I like the glare', '2005-02-01 11:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144271, 141760, 14735, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The colors are great and photo holds good balance. I like the effect true abstract art</td>', 'Very nice. The colors are great and photo holds good balance. I like the effect true abstract art', '2005-02-01 11:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144277, 141699, 14735, '<td valign="top">I do this myself and not sure if you have done anything about it but if you were just a hair over to the right it would have been perfect framing. I like the crop. Good photo</td>', 'I do this myself and not sure if you have done anything about it but if you were just a hair over to the right it would have been perfect framing. I like the crop. Good photo', '2005-02-01 11:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144279, 141607, 7438, '<td valign="top">I like this very much, especially the colors. Neon pink with a vintage looking yellow is a yummy combination.<br/> <br/>The composition works well too, dynamic and lively</td>', 'I like this very much, especially the colors. Neon pink with a vintage looking yellow is a yummy combination. The composition works well too, dynamic and lively', '2005-02-01 11:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144281, 141159, 14735, '<td valign="top">I wanted to use that for my movie title but my dogs keep running from the camera</td>', 'I wanted to use that for my movie title but my dogs keep running from the camera', '2005-02-01 11:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144282, 139438, 14735, '<td valign="top">Where do you people find this stuff. Very cool</td>', 'Where do you people find this stuff. Very cool', '2005-02-01 11:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144287, 141639, 7438, '<td valign="top">An abstract image like this needs to be tack sharp and slick in order to work, and although it''s an interesting idea the technical zing is missing, if you know what I mean.</td>', 'An abstract image like this needs to be tack sharp and slick in order to work, and although it''s an interesting idea the technical zing is missing, if you know what I mean.', '2005-02-01 11:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144291, 141700, 14735, '<td valign="top">Mystery theator 3000. If only they had hands they could take over the world. <br/>                                    No way, they would ban all the sushi</td>', 'Mystery theator 3000. If only they had hands they could take over the world.                                     No way, they would ban all the sushi', '2005-02-01 11:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144292, 141513, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice moody capture with play of light.</td>', 'Nice moody capture with play of light.', '2005-02-01 11:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144305, 139653, 7438, '<td valign="top">Clever, but has a snapshot feel to it with the harsh lighting on the horse, blown highlights and rather rough background</td>', 'Clever, but has a snapshot feel to it with the harsh lighting on the horse, blown highlights and rather rough background', '2005-02-01 11:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144350, 140929, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely photo. I like the use of empty space, but in this case I think a tighter crop would''ve been appropriate. The lighting is very effective and, combined with your model''s calm and relaxed appearance, this photo exudes serenity.</td>', 'This is a lovely photo. I like the use of empty space, but in this case I think a tighter crop would''ve been appropriate. The lighting is very effective and, combined with your model''s calm and relaxed appearance, this photo exudes serenity.', '2005-02-01 12:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144354, 141391, 13879, '<td valign="top">This is SO bizarre!</td>', 'This is SO bizarre!', '2005-02-01 12:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144359, 139612, 13879, '<td valign="top">This one is really clever and so simple, its works really well &amp; is one my my favourites in this challenge, bump up to 10!</td>', 'This one is really clever and so simple, its works really well & is one my my favourites in this challenge, bump up to 10!', '2005-02-01 12:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144360, 141008, 16636, '<td valign="top">From an old Cartographer - this is cool, good luck</td>', 'From an old Cartographer - this is cool, good luck', '2005-02-01 12:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144362, 141775, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think this prism is awesome. The photo would''ve benefited from a total crop right down to the apex of the prism, though. You''ve got it nice and sharp there and the prism is what makes this photo interesting. The buildings don''t add any interest (in my opinion) because the glass is dirty and the focus didn''t come out too well. But that prism, especially at the apex, is as sharp and beautiful as can be.</td>', 'I think this prism is awesome. The photo would''ve benefited from a total crop right down to the apex of the prism, though. You''ve got it nice and sharp there and the prism is what makes this photo interesting. The buildings don''t add any interest (in my opinion) because the glass is dirty and the focus didn''t come out too well. But that prism, especially at the apex, is as sharp and beautiful as can be.', '2005-02-01 12:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144364, 141645, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement. It could''ve benefited from the light being lit, if that were possible through some legal trick of Photoshop. The photo seems a little "flat" to me, but  I like the background color and light you''ve chosen very much.</td>', 'Nice arrangement. It could''ve benefited from the light being lit, if that were possible through some legal trick of Photoshop. The photo seems a little "flat" to me, but  I like the background color and light you''ve chosen very much.', '2005-02-01 12:44:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1144366, 141353, 31133, '<td valign="top">The title matches the photo perfectly. You''ve got a nice double meaning here. The shot may have had even more impact had it been in color.</td>', 'The title matches the photo perfectly. You''ve got a nice double meaning here. The shot may have had even more impact had it been in color.', '2005-02-01 12:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144371, 141555, 31133, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to say about this shot - it seems perfect in every way with respect to color, light, and focus, but it seems to me that it lacks something. I wonder if the shot would''ve been more interesting if the candle were in one of the lower corners of the frame instead of in the center.</td>', 'I don''t know what to say about this shot - it seems perfect in every way with respect to color, light, and focus, but it seems to me that it lacks something. I wonder if the shot would''ve been more interesting if the candle were in one of the lower corners of the frame instead of in the center.', '2005-02-01 12:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144377, 141417, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice color treatment and very cool action candid. I''d like to see a little less shadow on the left, though - but maybe the darker shadows is the way you intended it to be.</td>', 'Nice color treatment and very cool action candid. I''d like to see a little less shadow on the left, though - but maybe the darker shadows is the way you intended it to be.', '2005-02-01 12:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144382, 141122, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love, love, love this shot and quite honestly have no helpful comments to make. Some of the things I love about it are the way you captured the fog, the blue-grey tone you''ve chosen, and the fact that you didn''t clone out the airplane zig-zag lines.</td>', 'I love, love, love this shot and quite honestly have no helpful comments to make. Some of the things I love about it are the way you captured the fog, the blue-grey tone you''ve chosen, and the fact that you didn''t clone out the airplane zig-zag lines.', '2005-02-01 12:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144385, 141593, 31175, '<td valign="top">A slight rotation to bring the lighthouse vertical would be an improvement</td>', 'A slight rotation to bring the lighthouse vertical would be an improvement', '2005-02-01 12:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144388, 139697, 7438, '<td valign="top">The lake is beautiful and so is the sky, but too bad you''ve got houses and trees getting in the way. Bare trees make for interesting silhouettes, but the lake deserves more attention in my opinion</td>', 'The lake is beautiful and so is the sky, but too bad you''ve got houses and trees getting in the way. Bare trees make for interesting silhouettes, but the lake deserves more attention in my opinion', '2005-02-01 12:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144389, 140911, 31133, '<td valign="top">Usually I love lots of color in photographs, but in this case I think black and white or sepia would''ve been great. The smoke from the chimney on the right adds a lot of interest, but it''s not as prominent as it could be - that may just be my crappy monitor, though.</td>', 'Usually I love lots of color in photographs, but in this case I think black and white or sepia would''ve been great. The smoke from the chimney on the right adds a lot of interest, but it''s not as prominent as it could be - that may just be my crappy monitor, though.', '2005-02-01 12:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144401, 141876, 31175, '<td valign="top">Very ingenious!</td>', 'Very ingenious!', '2005-02-01 12:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144412, 141705, 7438, '<td valign="top">Lots of negative space is all well and good, but in this case I''d want to see more of the chimneys, and they''re a little bit tilted to the right as well which throws off the composition.</td>', 'Lots of negative space is all well and good, but in this case I''d want to see more of the chimneys, and they''re a little bit tilted to the right as well which throws off the composition.', '2005-02-01 13:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144421, 141156, 25024, '<td valign="top">very well executed concept, lovely colours and I bet this was not your first attempt! Well done</td>', 'very well executed concept, lovely colours and I bet this was not your first attempt! Well done', '2005-02-01 13:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144425, 141895, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good composition and a well taken difficult exposure.</td>', 'Good composition and a well taken difficult exposure.', '2005-02-01 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144445, 141818, 25024, '<td valign="top">You have created a great image here but I think it could have been so much more powerful if the light trace had not been there between the bulbs - or have I missed the point. Good luck</td>', 'You have created a great image here but I think it could have been so much more powerful if the light trace had not been there between the bulbs - or have I missed the point. Good luck', '2005-02-01 13:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144469, 141894, 3569, '<td valign="top">I love that Tunnel Drive walk, a bit of snow too.</td>', 'I love that Tunnel Drive walk, a bit of snow too.', '2005-02-01 13:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
