(1144857, 141466, 31214, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the way the hood melts into the black.  I like the composition, off to the right.  I like the slight blue cast on the hood.  I like the shadows on the face. I know that this wasn''t a hurried shot and that a lot of patience and attempts probably went into it.  This is an absolute 10.  Congratulations on your probable ribbon!</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the way the hood melts into the black.  I like the composition, off to the right.  I like the slight blue cast on the hood.  I like the shadows on the face. I know that this wasn''t a hurried shot and that a lot of patience and attempts probably went into it.  This is an absolute 10.  Congratulations on your probable ribbon!', '2005-02-01 19:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
