(1144865, 141685, 31214, '<td valign="top">What''s not to love?  I like how the candle light shows in the eyes.  Perhaps too much glare on the front tooth.  Beautiful/stunning model. Good composition.</td>', 'What''s not to love?  I like how the candle light shows in the eyes.  Perhaps too much glare on the front tooth.  Beautiful/stunning model. Good composition.', '2005-02-01 19:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144875, 141534, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Personal taste: I would have liked to see the shadow on the left side of the face follow the contours of the nose more closely: as is,  the double shadow gives a clownish (distorted mirror) look to the figure  at the dimple and . . . especially around the chin.  BOL -  and still a high mark. And I wish I could accomplish something even relatively close to this!</td>', 'Very pretty.  Personal taste: I would have liked to see the shadow on the left side of the face follow the contours of the nose more closely: as is,  the double shadow gives a clownish (distorted mirror) look to the figure  at the dimple and . . . especially around the chin.  BOL -  and still a high mark. And I wish I could accomplish something even relatively close to this!', '2005-02-01 19:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1144878, 141512, 31214, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I really like the way the long stems of the grass continue with a pattern of tall trees in the distance.  I can really "feel" the day coming to a close and the kids trying to extract every ounce of joy out of it.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I really like the way the long stems of the grass continue with a pattern of tall trees in the distance.  I can really "feel" the day coming to a close and the kids trying to extract every ounce of joy out of it.  Well done!', '2005-02-01 19:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
