(1145888, 141833, 23251, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see this cropped a little on the right hand side.  Cute photo that I think could have done much better with a closer crop.</td>', 'I would have liked to see this cropped a little on the right hand side.  Cute photo that I think could have done much better with a closer crop.', '2005-02-02 06:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145893, 141676, 23251, '<td valign="top">A great idea.  Maybe if you cropped the lower reflections out and allowed a little more negative space above the higher light bulb it would have a better impact?  As it is IMHO it is to close to the top with no where to go.  Very nice though, well done!</td>', 'A great idea.  Maybe if you cropped the lower reflections out and allowed a little more negative space above the higher light bulb it would have a better impact?  As it is IMHO it is to close to the top with no where to go.  Very nice though, well done!', '2005-02-02 06:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145900, 141798, 23251, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo that looks a little over processed with a distinctive halo on the outline of the house.  That could be caused by over sharpening but could also be from the back lighting.  A very difficult shot to capture into the sun like that.  Well done.</td>', 'A very nice photo that looks a little over processed with a distinctive halo on the outline of the house.  That could be caused by over sharpening but could also be from the back lighting.  A very difficult shot to capture into the sun like that.  Well done.', '2005-02-02 06:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145903, 141704, 32885, '<td valign="top">...of the tunnel is a train! Good photo.</td>', '...of the tunnel is a train! Good photo.', '2005-02-02 06:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145906, 141526, 23251, '<td valign="top">The idea is good but unfortunatly IMHO the light looks placed and independant of the photo.  It could be that the desat has caused the light and its colour to stand out to much.  Good idea though.</td>', 'The idea is good but unfortunatly IMHO the light looks placed and independant of the photo.  It could be that the desat has caused the light and its colour to stand out to much.  Good idea though.', '2005-02-02 06:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145909, 141216, 32885, '<td valign="top">Cute shot but it''s a pity the subject is not looking at the light.</td>', 'Cute shot but it''s a pity the subject is not looking at the light.', '2005-02-02 06:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145910, 141661, 23251, '<td valign="top">Sorry I just don''t see how his shows off any photographic skills.</td>', 'Sorry I just don''t see how his shows off any photographic skills.', '2005-02-02 06:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145911, 141526, 32885, '<td valign="top">A very interesting photo. What is the subject thinking?</td>', 'A very interesting photo. What is the subject thinking?', '2005-02-02 06:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145912, 141794, 17047, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. The lighting gives the image  an ethereal atmosphere. A 10 from me.</td>', 'This is wonderful. The lighting gives the image  an ethereal atmosphere. A 10 from me.', '2005-02-02 06:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145914, 140567, 23251, '<td valign="top">Sorry the photo is very small and blured with funny squiggly things.  I would suggest you look in the tutorial section for re sizing photos for a challenge.</td>', 'Sorry the photo is very small and blured with funny squiggly things.  I would suggest you look in the tutorial section for re sizing photos for a challenge.', '2005-02-02 06:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
