(1145922, 141890, 17047, '<td valign="top">I have spent way too long being hypnotised by this! I can''t figure out whether you''re really good or just really crazy ;-)</td>', 'I have spent way too long being hypnotised by this! I can''t figure out whether you''re really good or just really crazy ;-)', '2005-02-02 06:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
