(1146227, 140629, 14028, '<td valign="top">good architectural shot.well exposed and composed,congrats!</td>', 'good architectural shot.well exposed and composed,congrats!', '2005-02-02 09:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146235, 141850, 14028, '<td valign="top">good macro shot,like the colours.</td>', 'good macro shot,like the colours.', '2005-02-02 09:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146238, 141201, 14028, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2005-02-02 09:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146342, 139612, 16230, '<td valign="top">"That''s not a moon--it''s a space station!" Neat idea. Well executed.</td>', '"That''s not a moon--it''s a space station!" Neat idea. Well executed.', '2005-02-02 09:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146368, 141116, 14735, '<td valign="top">Looks like you put a CD in the microwave</td>', 'Looks like you put a CD in the microwave', '2005-02-02 10:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146492, 141353, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an amazingly beautiful image.  i only know of three people who would have submitted an image such as this, and if you aren''t on my faves list, you probably soon will be.  thanks for sharing such an incredible capture.  to me, this image captures the essence of photography:  capturing an instance of reflected light.  even if this doesn''t score well, it is images like this that hopefully will start to blow the doors off around here!</td>', 'what an amazingly beautiful image.  i only know of three people who would have submitted an image such as this, and if you aren''t on my faves list, you probably soon will be.  thanks for sharing such an incredible capture.  to me, this image captures the essence of photography:  capturing an instance of reflected light.  even if this doesn''t score well, it is images like this that hopefully will start to blow the doors off around here!', '2005-02-02 10:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146512, 141749, 30332, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! Was it taken from Angel island? What time of the day?</td>', 'Nice shot! Was it taken from Angel island? What time of the day?', '2005-02-02 10:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146624, 141704, 21714, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I like how the structure pulls you in to the light with tremendous force.  There''s a nice balance of light/shadow too, but I think it oculd actually be darkened by 1/2 stop or contrast can be increased a tad bit.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I like how the structure pulls you in to the light with tremendous force.  There''s a nice balance of light/shadow too, but I think it oculd actually be darkened by 1/2 stop or contrast can be increased a tad bit.', '2005-02-02 11:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146625, 141122, 21714, '<td valign="top">I think you have done a superb job in capturing the atmosphere. I like it a lot. Makes me want to be there.</td>', 'I think you have done a superb job in capturing the atmosphere. I like it a lot. Makes me want to be there.', '2005-02-02 11:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146628, 141465, 21714, '<td valign="top">Totally different take on the challenge and I actually like this a lot.</td>', 'Totally different take on the challenge and I actually like this a lot.', '2005-02-02 11:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146630, 141417, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like the exposure here but I am not too sure about the composition. I can imagine the same light and exposure with a horizontal composition with the guy at the very edge of the frame.  Something like that - something different and more dramatic.</td>', 'I like the exposure here but I am not too sure about the composition. I can imagine the same light and exposure with a horizontal composition with the guy at the very edge of the frame.  Something like that - something different and more dramatic.', '2005-02-02 11:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146634, 141898, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very creative and interesting image. I like it a lot but at the same time wonder if it would have been better if the star effect was smaller. There''s something about that star I am not too sure about.</td>', 'Very creative and interesting image. I like it a lot but at the same time wonder if it would have been better if the star effect was smaller. There''s something about that star I am not too sure about.', '2005-02-02 11:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146637, 141566, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very striking image and I like the distance and scale in this.</td>', 'Very striking image and I like the distance and scale in this.', '2005-02-02 11:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146641, 141045, 21714, '<td valign="top">I think this is absolutely brilliant. I find the image beautiful. The light, angle and treatment works really well for the model. Excellent!</td>', 'I think this is absolutely brilliant. I find the image beautiful. The light, angle and treatment works really well for the model. Excellent!', '2005-02-02 11:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146674, 141122, 27137, '<td valign="top">oo i see a winner</td>', 'oo i see a winner', '2005-02-02 12:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146693, 140929, 33059, '<td valign="top">tjena faan va bra bild.</td>', 'tjena faan va bra bild.', '2005-02-02 12:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146721, 141513, 16636, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, I like the contrast very muchand the bright vanishing point to draw your eye through the picture and the angle of capture is also excellent. Hope this does well - 10</td>', 'This is really nice, I like the contrast very muchand the bright vanishing point to draw your eye through the picture and the angle of capture is also excellent. Hope this does well - 10', '2005-02-02 12:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146723, 140319, 32810, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a modern "cool" light device</td>', 'Nice capture of a modern "cool" light device', '2005-02-02 12:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146725, 141212, 16636, '<td valign="top">nicely held on the expossure, could almost have entered the pink challenge as well?</td>', 'nicely held on the expossure, could almost have entered the pink challenge as well?', '2005-02-02 12:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146727, 141386, 16636, '<td valign="top">maybe better to shoot at night to emphasis ''light''?</td>', 'maybe better to shoot at night to emphasis ''light''?', '2005-02-02 12:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146734, 139620, 16636, '<td valign="top">very cool - a ribbon predicted!</td>', 'very cool - a ribbon predicted!', '2005-02-02 12:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146737, 141818, 25754, '<td valign="top">Neat effect!</td>', 'Neat effect!', '2005-02-02 12:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146744, 141801, 25754, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The BW works really well with this.</td>', 'Very nice. The BW works really well with this.', '2005-02-02 12:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146794, 141000, 14735, '<td valign="top">Love the angel and the lighting</td>', 'Love the angel and the lighting', '2005-02-02 12:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146801, 141515, 14735, '<td valign="top">Enough detail to make it out and soft enough to be quite pleasing.</td>', 'Enough detail to make it out and soft enough to be quite pleasing.', '2005-02-02 12:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146808, 141439, 14735, '<td valign="top">Fantasic lighting, great job</td>', 'Fantasic lighting, great job', '2005-02-02 12:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146812, 141112, 14735, '<td valign="top">This could have been better if there was a bit more light variation.</td>', 'This could have been better if there was a bit more light variation.', '2005-02-02 13:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146853, 141188, 6999, '<td valign="top">Shooting from the same vertical angle as the striped light has negated a real possibility of ehhancing the sense of shape, of three dimensions here: given the background straight lines, some sense of curve might have really been useful across the petals of the flower. The texture is good, and the tonality, and the grey backing especially effective to set off those tones ... but it cries out of missed opportunity to me.</td>', 'Shooting from the same vertical angle as the striped light has negated a real possibility of ehhancing the sense of shape, of three dimensions here: given the background straight lines, some sense of curve might have really been useful across the petals of the flower. The texture is good, and the tonality, and the grey backing especially effective to set off those tones ... but it cries out of missed opportunity to me.', '2005-02-02 13:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146893, 141644, 25143, '<td valign="top">great sense of humour ! very nice photo , unusual and nice simplicity</td>', 'great sense of humour ! very nice photo , unusual and nice simplicity', '2005-02-02 13:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146901, 139612, 25143, '<td valign="top">great sense of humour - neat composition</td>', 'great sense of humour - neat composition', '2005-02-02 13:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147074, 141485, 22479, '<td valign="top">What rich colors and clarity, even shooting into the sun. I suggest a slight counter clockwise rotation to level out the horizon. The dynamic range (or your post processing) of your camera is quite impressive given the subtle silhouettes of the trees superimposed on the distant hills. <br/> <br/>While I think this composition works, perhaps a focal point of something in the lake would have added to the interest of the foreground, like a boat, or a fisherman. I<br/> <br/>I''ll score this an 8.</td>', 'What rich colors and clarity, even shooting into the sun. I suggest a slight counter clockwise rotation to level out the horizon. The dynamic range (or your post processing) of your camera is quite impressive given the subtle silhouettes of the trees superimposed on the distant hills.  While I think this composition works, perhaps a focal point of something in the lake would have added to the interest of the foreground, like a boat, or a fisherman. I I''ll score this an 8.', '2005-02-02 15:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147079, 141499, 22479, '<td valign="top">A nice revisit of the famous original. <br/> <br/>Perhaps a little bit more ambient light to define the perimeter of your composition would have been an improvement, since as it is the periphery is quite dark. Overall a good image with a lot of pop. 7</td>', 'A nice revisit of the famous original.  Perhaps a little bit more ambient light to define the perimeter of your composition would have been an improvement, since as it is the periphery is quite dark. Overall a good image with a lot of pop. 7', '2005-02-02 15:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147084, 140161, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice take on this challenge. Very imaginative and your composition of the contrasting figures is quite excellent. Perhaps if you had shot a tad bit wider, to put more space between the elderly gentleman''s head and the edge of the frame, the image would not be as claustrophobic. Especially given his dozing pose, he really looks cramped :-)<br/> <br/>Overall I really like this one and I will score this one an 8.</td>', 'Nice take on this challenge. Very imaginative and your composition of the contrasting figures is quite excellent. Perhaps if you had shot a tad bit wider, to put more space between the elderly gentleman''s head and the edge of the frame, the image would not be as claustrophobic. Especially given his dozing pose, he really looks cramped :-) Overall I really like this one and I will score this one an 8.', '2005-02-02 15:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147095, 141645, 22479, '<td valign="top">Sometimes simplicity is the answer, and I think you''ve effectively utilized it.<br/> <br/>I like this entry but I feel this could be improved if it was focused a tad bit better, or selectively sharpened a hair more at the screw. The grey backdrop is not very flattering. I suggest going for a more high key approach, or a low key, perhaps a black backdrop. Still, overall a good entry.</td>', 'Sometimes simplicity is the answer, and I think you''ve effectively utilized it. I like this entry but I feel this could be improved if it was focused a tad bit better, or selectively sharpened a hair more at the screw. The grey backdrop is not very flattering. I suggest going for a more high key approach, or a low key, perhaps a black backdrop. Still, overall a good entry.', '2005-02-02 15:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147103, 141893, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent high key exposure. Simplicity can be very effective as you have shown here. My only recommendation would be to soften the edges of the shadows which were more sharply demarcated after your post processing, and perhaps to remove the border, or have a thin solid black one. Very well done overall. 7</td>', 'Excellent high key exposure. Simplicity can be very effective as you have shown here. My only recommendation would be to soften the edges of the shadows which were more sharply demarcated after your post processing, and perhaps to remove the border, or have a thin solid black one. Very well done overall. 7', '2005-02-02 15:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147109, 140319, 22479, '<td valign="top">Wild plasma glow. I have no idea what this is, or who or what Zartha is, but this image just has a lot of WOW.  Very well captured. 8</td>', 'Wild plasma glow. I have no idea what this is, or who or what Zartha is, but this image just has a lot of WOW.  Very well captured. 8', '2005-02-02 15:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147110, 141847, 6349, '<td valign="top">Is this the TZ bridge from Dobbs Ferry?</td>', 'Is this the TZ bridge from Dobbs Ferry?', '2005-02-02 15:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147115, 139697, 22479, '<td valign="top">Fantastic exposure. Excellent tonal range with subtle shades of blue/purple hills and magical glow in the sky. Perhaps a hair more sky and a hair less house/roof, or selectively silhouette the buildings below. I''ll score this one a 7</td>', 'Fantastic exposure. Excellent tonal range with subtle shades of blue/purple hills and magical glow in the sky. Perhaps a hair more sky and a hair less house/roof, or selectively silhouette the buildings below. I''ll score this one a 7', '2005-02-02 15:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147122, 140825, 22479, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Great contrast of ice cold blue interior and glowing hot (lightbulb?) underneath the bed. 7</td>', 'I really like this. Great contrast of ice cold blue interior and glowing hot (lightbulb?) underneath the bed. 7', '2005-02-02 15:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147130, 141514, 22479, '<td valign="top">Have you considered a hue shift? I wonder how this would appear in an electric blue. I think the stars save this exposure, as the lower right is a bit hot. Had you decreased the exposure length, perhaps those stars might have not manifested itself. Overall a very dramatic and mysterious entry. 7</td>', 'Have you considered a hue shift? I wonder how this would appear in an electric blue. I think the stars save this exposure, as the lower right is a bit hot. Had you decreased the exposure length, perhaps those stars might have not manifested itself. Overall a very dramatic and mysterious entry. 7', '2005-02-02 15:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147134, 140319, 32449, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, very mystical</td>', 'Nice photo, very mystical', '2005-02-02 15:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147135, 141712, 32449, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition.  This has a very warm feeling to it for me</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition.  This has a very warm feeling to it for me', '2005-02-02 15:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
