(1147208, 141663, 22479, '<td valign="top">Your title has it backwards, which if you are Christian, is quite sacriligeous. :-) <br/> <br/>Whether that is your intent or not is not that relevant, just a side note. On to the picture. The composition is good overalll. The child''s curiosity is evident in his bright upward gaze. The candle is also nicely exposed with the shaft fading into darkness. The point lighting is quite effective. <br/> <br/>The image could be a bit sharper but in this particular composition is just a minor issue  as the soft focus is flattering in the setting of the warm glow of the candlelight. Overall well done. 7</td>', 'Your title has it backwards, which if you are Christian, is quite sacriligeous. :-)  Whether that is your intent or not is not that relevant, just a side note. On to the picture. The composition is good overalll. The child''s curiosity is evident in his bright upward gaze. The candle is also nicely exposed with the shaft fading into darkness. The point lighting is quite effective.  The image could be a bit sharper but in this particular composition is just a minor issue  as the soft focus is flattering in the setting of the warm glow of the candlelight. Overall well done. 7', '2005-02-02 16:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147210, 141156, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract photo. Wonder how you did this...</td>', 'Nice abstract photo. Wonder how you did this...', '2005-02-02 16:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147217, 141664, 22479, '<td valign="top">Well composed. Would have been more effective if the dark spot above the car within the reflection was edited out. I imagine it was not easy to fill the filter ring with the whole reflection, so this is not a major point. Overall quite well done, 7</td>', 'Well composed. Would have been more effective if the dark spot above the car within the reflection was edited out. I imagine it was not easy to fill the filter ring with the whole reflection, so this is not a major point. Overall quite well done, 7', '2005-02-02 16:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147227, 141518, 22479, '<td valign="top">The girl''s right eye is startlingly white. I think it distracts and is too artifically dodged. Aside from that quite minor issue, the rest of the photograph is quite lovely with great focus, exposure, and a nice bokeh going on back there. 7</td>', 'The girl''s right eye is startlingly white. I think it distracts and is too artifically dodged. Aside from that quite minor issue, the rest of the photograph is quite lovely with great focus, exposure, and a nice bokeh going on back there. 7', '2005-02-02 16:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
