(1149940, 140881, 17507, '<td valign="top">blurred background is a nice touch. i also like the bold primaries.</td>', 'blurred background is a nice touch. i also like the bold primaries.', '2005-02-04 00:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149945, 139433, 17507, '<td valign="top">cooperative sky!  i wish the bolts (especially those on the right) were a bit sharper. might have been worth experimenting with cropping/dodging a little bit more to bring out the details there.</td>', 'cooperative sky!  i wish the bolts (especially those on the right) were a bit sharper. might have been worth experimenting with cropping/dodging a little bit more to bring out the details there.', '2005-02-04 00:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149951, 139438, 17507, '<td valign="top">great light for sure. i feel like the impact of this photo could have been helped a lot by a tighter crop, though- seems like there''s too much of the thing showing. composition is a bit weak, which i think could have been fixed by a substantially closer crop.</td>', 'great light for sure. i feel like the impact of this photo could have been helped a lot by a tighter crop, though- seems like there''s too much of the thing showing. composition is a bit weak, which i think could have been fixed by a substantially closer crop.', '2005-02-04 00:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149954, 141044, 17507, '<td valign="top">Lots of steam... coming from goodness knows what...<br/>fabulous shot. (9)</td>', 'Lots of steam... coming from goodness knows what...fabulous shot. (9)', '2005-02-04 00:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149958, 141901, 17507, '<td valign="top">looks like this was a dangerous shot to take..!<br/></td>', 'looks like this was a dangerous shot to take..!', '2005-02-04 00:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149967, 140227, 17507, '<td valign="top">wow, this is so very "dark side of the moon" . . .</td>', 'wow, this is so very "dark side of the moon" . . .', '2005-02-04 00:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149968, 139697, 20168, '<td valign="top">I would have scored this shot higher if you had cropped out the distracting building in the lower portion of the frame.  Beautiful dawn photo.</td>', 'I would have scored this shot higher if you had cropped out the distracting building in the lower portion of the frame.  Beautiful dawn photo.', '2005-02-04 00:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149977, 141146, 25464, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of this shot.  Great color.  I think I would crop in the left so that the diagonal shadow hit the lower left corner.  That would also remove the lone little tree on the left, leaving a cleaner line.</td>', 'I love the feel of this shot.  Great color.  I think I would crop in the left so that the diagonal shadow hit the lower left corner.  That would also remove the lone little tree on the left, leaving a cleaner line.', '2005-02-04 00:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149980, 141593, 20168, '<td valign="top">Emotive photo.  The absence of light shining from the lighthouse takes away from the potential power of the shot.  Sometimes though there is only the photo that is before us rather than the photo we had hoped would be before us.  Good luck.</td>', 'Emotive photo.  The absence of light shining from the lighthouse takes away from the potential power of the shot.  Sometimes though there is only the photo that is before us rather than the photo we had hoped would be before us.  Good luck.', '2005-02-04 00:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149983, 139612, 25464, '<td valign="top">What a great idea and a great simple image.  I bet you could make a mint with this one in the right setting.  What a great golf logo that would make.</td>', 'What a great idea and a great simple image.  I bet you could make a mint with this one in the right setting.  What a great golf logo that would make.', '2005-02-04 00:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149985, 141212, 25464, '<td valign="top">A little lacking compositionally.  No real focal point, but beautiful color, light, and reflections.  It needed a good foreground subject.</td>', 'A little lacking compositionally.  No real focal point, but beautiful color, light, and reflections.  It needed a good foreground subject.', '2005-02-04 00:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149987, 140479, 25464, '<td valign="top">I am always amazed when someone can take something this mundane and simple and make it art.  Great shot.</td>', 'I am always amazed when someone can take something this mundane and simple and make it art.  Great shot.', '2005-02-04 00:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149994, 141875, 20168, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the lighting of the globes would have been more attractive if there had been no flash, but only a longer exposure with a higher camera angle.  Just a thought.  Cool location to capture this challenge.</td>', 'Perhaps the lighting of the globes would have been more attractive if there had been no flash, but only a longer exposure with a higher camera angle.  Just a thought.  Cool location to capture this challenge.', '2005-02-04 00:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149997, 141518, 25464, '<td valign="top">Librodo strikes again.  Lovely girl.  I am a huge fan of your work, but I don''t think this is one of your best.  It seems a bit too dark and I am not sure the sliver of light on her face really adds anything to the photo.  The background tones and the DOF are perfect.</td>', 'Librodo strikes again.  Lovely girl.  I am a huge fan of your work, but I don''t think this is one of your best.  It seems a bit too dark and I am not sure the sliver of light on her face really adds anything to the photo.  The background tones and the DOF are perfect.', '2005-02-04 00:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149998, 141763, 25464, '<td valign="top">Interesting, artsy, lovely.</td>', 'Interesting, artsy, lovely.', '2005-02-04 00:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150004, 141615, 30959, '<td valign="top">Very nice, wish it were larger. Good eye on this shot.</td>', 'Very nice, wish it were larger. Good eye on this shot.', '2005-02-04 00:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150008, 141156, 30959, '<td valign="top">What a marvelous piece of art.</td>', 'What a marvelous piece of art.', '2005-02-04 00:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150010, 141760, 30959, '<td valign="top">YOW...well done and what a nice picture it makes.  Painting with light... very nice.</td>', 'YOW...well done and what a nice picture it makes.  Painting with light... very nice.', '2005-02-04 01:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150011, 141146, 30959, '<td valign="top">NIce job of balance, composition, light and shadow...</td>', 'NIce job of balance, composition, light and shadow...', '2005-02-04 01:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150014, 141687, 30959, '<td valign="top">What a story here..well done all the way round, the gate, shadows, play of light, one hidden eye, and one still looking...beauty and harshness....I can learn a lot from this photo.</td>', 'What a story here..well done all the way round, the gate, shadows, play of light, one hidden eye, and one still looking...beauty and harshness....I can learn a lot from this photo.', '2005-02-04 01:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150037, 139433, 16230, '<td valign="top">Scary and very cool! Congrats!</td>', 'Scary and very cool! Congrats!', '2005-02-04 01:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150038, 141634, 16230, '<td valign="top">Looks like we have a winner! Well done.</td>', 'Looks like we have a winner! Well done.', '2005-02-04 01:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150044, 139837, 30364, '<td valign="top">Great image.  It looks like a certain mushroom I''ve seen, so it''s either a terrific photograph, or it''s a terrific photograph AND a nice tribute.  9</td>', 'Great image.  It looks like a certain mushroom I''ve seen, so it''s either a terrific photograph, or it''s a terrific photograph AND a nice tribute.  9', '2005-02-04 02:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150047, 140012, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful, sensuous photograph.  Elegantly composed and well executed.  And of course the lighting is striking; it''s the reason that this image works.  Challenge well met. 9</td>', 'A very beautiful, sensuous photograph.  Elegantly composed and well executed.  And of course the lighting is striking; it''s the reason that this image works.  Challenge well met. 9', '2005-02-04 02:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150051, 141759, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is ALL about light.  The architecture, the composition, the camera and the processing.  I''ve seen a photograph of this dome before, not looking quite so pale.  So I''ll be interested in the comments of that photographer (if it ain''t you, of course).  8</td>', 'This is ALL about light.  The architecture, the composition, the camera and the processing.  I''ve seen a photograph of this dome before, not looking quite so pale.  So I''ll be interested in the comments of that photographer (if it ain''t you, of course).  8', '2005-02-04 02:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150055, 141755, 30364, '<td valign="top">Everyone will say Monet, I guess.  It''s a beautiful image for several reasons, but in particular it''s a very impressive and instructive study of the effect of light on different surfaces and textures.  8.</td>', 'Everyone will say Monet, I guess.  It''s a beautiful image for several reasons, but in particular it''s a very impressive and instructive study of the effect of light on different surfaces and textures.  8.', '2005-02-04 02:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150061, 141518, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  It uses light in three ways to maximise the impact ... the soft shadow on the RH face, the bright slash of sunlight on LH face, and the bokeh-type background over the left shoulder.  And the image would be diminished by the absence of any of the three.  Well done.  8</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.  It uses light in three ways to maximise the impact ... the soft shadow on the RH face, the bright slash of sunlight on LH face, and the bokeh-type background over the left shoulder.  And the image would be diminished by the absence of any of the three.  Well done.  8', '2005-02-04 02:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150068, 141608, 30364, '<td valign="top">I see this as a three-way satisfaction of the challenge ... the beacon(s), the sparkling light on the water, and the light, open composition.  And I like all three.  8</td>', 'I see this as a three-way satisfaction of the challenge ... the beacon(s), the sparkling light on the water, and the light, open composition.  And I like all three.  8', '2005-02-04 02:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150083, 141817, 30364, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is ... something fermenting?  Something melting?  Whatever it is, it''s hard to resist.  I''m betting it is an unremarkable subject into which you''ve breathed life with your clever perception of the light on the thing rather than the thing itself.  7</td>', 'I don''t know what this is ... something fermenting?  Something melting?  Whatever it is, it''s hard to resist.  I''m betting it is an unremarkable subject into which you''ve breathed life with your clever perception of the light on the thing rather than the thing itself.  7', '2005-02-04 03:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150087, 141634, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is nicely composed to effectively exploit the contrast between the reflected lights and the pitch black night sky.  Looks a bit grainy, but then again so do I.  7</td>', 'This is nicely composed to effectively exploit the contrast between the reflected lights and the pitch black night sky.  Looks a bit grainy, but then again so do I.  7', '2005-02-04 03:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150091, 141305, 30364, '<td valign="top">The most original idea anyone had.  And you know what?  It''s not just a clever stunt, it is a very nice photograph.  It has the look of a carefully composed abstract image.  So I guess that''s what it must be.  7</td>', 'The most original idea anyone had.  And you know what?  It''s not just a clever stunt, it is a very nice photograph.  It has the look of a carefully composed abstract image.  So I guess that''s what it must be.  7', '2005-02-04 03:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150096, 141499, 33093, '<td valign="top">Good idea and perfect shot.</td>', 'Good idea and perfect shot.', '2005-02-04 03:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150102, 141794, 30364, '<td valign="top">I think the light effect is OK here; not brilliant but not bad ... the highlights are a bit too high for me (although I am of course aware that it was intentional).  But what I think is extremely impressive is your composition and cropping, which I think are perfect for the subject, and give the image great artistic impact.  8</td>', 'I think the light effect is OK here; not brilliant but not bad ... the highlights are a bit too high for me (although I am of course aware that it was intentional).  But what I think is extremely impressive is your composition and cropping, which I think are perfect for the subject, and give the image great artistic impact.  8', '2005-02-04 03:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150116, 141765, 30364, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this kind of shot normally ... I usually think "contrived studio shot" and pass it by.  But this does have some real impact.  The light grabs the attention, of course, but there''s also something more than that.  It''s probably better than I think, and I was thinking 6.  So ... it''s a  7</td>', 'I don''t like this kind of shot normally ... I usually think "contrived studio shot" and pass it by.  But this does have some real impact.  The light grabs the attention, of course, but there''s also something more than that.  It''s probably better than I think, and I was thinking 6.  So ... it''s a  7', '2005-02-04 04:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150119, 141175, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty clever.  Nicely lit, too.  I nearly dismissed it as a witty stunt, but it''s really a very appealing and original portrait.  7</td>', 'That''s pretty clever.  Nicely lit, too.  I nearly dismissed it as a witty stunt, but it''s really a very appealing and original portrait.  7', '2005-02-04 04:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150120, 141789, 30364, '<td valign="top">I love the effect of the light on the snow.  Like height contours on a topographical map.  The bench is also terrific.  Nice composition.  7</td>', 'I love the effect of the light on the snow.  Like height contours on a topographical map.  The bench is also terrific.  Nice composition.  7', '2005-02-04 04:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150124, 140537, 30364, '<td valign="top">The fact that the figure is carrying something (coffee?) makes this so much more interesting.  Nice image with effective use of (back) light.  7</td>', 'The fact that the figure is carrying something (coffee?) makes this so much more interesting.  Nice image with effective use of (back) light.  7', '2005-02-04 04:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150129, 141670, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''m not mad about the soft focus, but it''s a nicely composed shot.  Cleanest alley I''ve ever seen, as well.  6</td>', 'I''m not mad about the soft focus, but it''s a nicely composed shot.  Cleanest alley I''ve ever seen, as well.  6', '2005-02-04 04:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150135, 141566, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like that the figure is standing erect; not bowed, sitting or kneeling.  It somehow makes me think more about the light than the religious or spiritual context.  7</td>', 'I like that the figure is standing erect; not bowed, sitting or kneeling.  It somehow makes me think more about the light than the religious or spiritual context.  7', '2005-02-04 04:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150138, 141593, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a nice seascape shot. but it is a little let down by the over-processed edges on the rocks (centre right) and by the inclination of the lighthouse.  I think a lighthouse has to be meticulously vertical to be taken seriously.  6</td>', 'This is a nice seascape shot. but it is a little let down by the over-processed edges on the rocks (centre right) and by the inclination of the lighthouse.  I think a lighthouse has to be meticulously vertical to be taken seriously.  6', '2005-02-04 04:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150139, 141034, 6999, '<td valign="top">Red is so difficult on computers - there''s a reason why so many of the most popular images on dpc feature blue. This is great though - pin sharp, and just perfectly saturated - has real impact but hasn''t gone into clipping anywhere that I can see.</td>', 'Red is so difficult on computers - there''s a reason why so many of the most popular images on dpc feature blue. This is great though - pin sharp, and just perfectly saturated - has real impact but hasn''t gone into clipping anywhere that I can see.', '2005-02-04 04:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150140, 141513, 30364, '<td valign="top">The light is certainly the dominant element of this image.  I''m not convinced that it has to be tilted, although I guess it saves you from having us all bitching about the verticals being just slightly out.  Anyway, it''s a very effective light study.  7</td>', 'The light is certainly the dominant element of this image.  I''m not convinced that it has to be tilted, although I guess it saves you from having us all bitching about the verticals being just slightly out.  Anyway, it''s a very effective light study.  7', '2005-02-04 04:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150142, 141348, 6999, '<td valign="top">Immensely likeable shot; has mystery, interest, depth - great tonality and sense of texture and atmosphere. I wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'Immensely likeable shot; has mystery, interest, depth - great tonality and sense of texture and atmosphere. I wouldn''t change a thing.', '2005-02-04 04:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150143, 141712, 30364, '<td valign="top">First I thought "It'' should be a B&amp;W shot, this".  But then I looked more closely at the beautiful green-to-gold effects in the sunlit strips, and I decided you were right after all.  It''s an appealing image and a very harmonious composition.  7</td>', 'First I thought "It'' should be a B&W shot, this".  But then I looked more closely at the beautiful green-to-gold effects in the sunlit strips, and I decided you were right after all.  It''s an appealing image and a very harmonious composition.  7', '2005-02-04 04:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150145, 141057, 6999, '<td valign="top">The best lit image here - strong sense of textures in both the steel and the skin; a very human shot, I think. Strong graphically too - it doesn''t quite grab me, as a subject, but there''s a lot of tonality here that I really do like.</td>', 'The best lit image here - strong sense of textures in both the steel and the skin; a very human shot, I think. Strong graphically too - it doesn''t quite grab me, as a subject, but there''s a lot of tonality here that I really do like.', '2005-02-04 04:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150146, 141887, 30364, '<td valign="top">There''s something surprising about this.  There''s not much to it, yet it has an impact.  I suppose it''s the starkness of the sparkling rock against the clouds (is it a rock?).  And the strip of black sky at the very top adds to the intrigue.  7</td>', 'There''s something surprising about this.  There''s not much to it, yet it has an impact.  I suppose it''s the starkness of the sparkling rock against the clouds (is it a rock?).  And the strip of black sky at the very top adds to the intrigue.  7', '2005-02-04 04:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150155, 141512, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is an attractive image.  The reeds in the foreground and the trees in the background seem to work together to lift this scene, and to provide some depth.  The patches of light on the ice conect the skaters nicely, too.  7</td>', 'This is an attractive image.  The reeds in the foreground and the trees in the background seem to work together to lift this scene, and to provide some depth.  The patches of light on the ice conect the skaters nicely, too.  7', '2005-02-04 04:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150156, 141699, 30364, '<td valign="top">A meticulously composed and cropped image.  Just feels a bit short on soul to me, as if there''s no real point to it.  It''s probably just the careful symmetry that doesn''t excite me.  The photo itself is technically very good, and it does showcase the effect of light quite well. 7</td>', 'A meticulously composed and cropped image.  Just feels a bit short on soul to me, as if there''s no real point to it.  It''s probably just the careful symmetry that doesn''t excite me.  The photo itself is technically very good, and it does showcase the effect of light quite well. 7', '2005-02-04 05:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150157, 141835, 5728, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling it is tilting to the right. It could be my eyes playing  tricks on me though. Nice exposure.</td>', 'I get the feeling it is tilting to the right. It could be my eyes playing  tricks on me though. Nice exposure.', '2005-02-04 05:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150158, 141386, 5728, '<td valign="top">It could have more impact with a touch more saturation.</td>', 'It could have more impact with a touch more saturation.', '2005-02-04 05:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150160, 141704, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a striking image, beautifully exposed.  It''s a bit tilted, which I usually wouldn''t bother commenting on, but in this case, with the exquisite geometrical detail of the bridge structure, the tilt seems inappropriate.  7</td>', 'This is a striking image, beautifully exposed.  It''s a bit tilted, which I usually wouldn''t bother commenting on, but in this case, with the exquisite geometrical detail of the bridge structure, the tilt seems inappropriate.  7', '2005-02-04 05:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150161, 141850, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lovely color combinations!</td>', 'Lovely color combinations!', '2005-02-04 05:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150163, 141485, 5728, '<td valign="top">It appears to be tilting to the right, but other than that, an awesome sunset.</td>', 'It appears to be tilting to the right, but other than that, an awesome sunset.', '2005-02-04 05:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150164, 141789, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cool textures in the snow. That is snow isn''t it?</td>', 'Cool textures in the snow. That is snow isn''t it?', '2005-02-04 05:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150165, 140779, 5728, '<td valign="top">Candle or pizza? :))) Interesting....</td>', 'Candle or pizza? :))) Interesting....', '2005-02-04 05:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150166, 141347, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea!</td>', 'Good idea!', '2005-02-04 05:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150167, 139612, 5728, '<td valign="top">So that is what the moon looks like close up :) Good idea, clever!</td>', 'So that is what the moon looks like close up :) Good idea, clever!', '2005-02-04 05:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150168, 140012, 5728, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting cuve combination!</td>', 'Love the lighting cuve combination!', '2005-02-04 05:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150169, 141321, 30364, '<td valign="top">I think this is too much in your face (pardon the pun).  The subject seems so close as to be overwhelming, so that the moody &amp; mysterious effect of your strong side lighting is diminished.  It feels more like a shot of an eye and a nostril to me.  Sorry.  5</td>', 'I think this is too much in your face (pardon the pun).  The subject seems so close as to be overwhelming, so that the moody & mysterious effect of your strong side lighting is diminished.  It feels more like a shot of an eye and a nostril to me.  Sorry.  5', '2005-02-04 05:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150171, 141891, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a striking visual effect but leaves me a bit disappointed.  Maybe it''s my age; when you say "Purple Haze" to me I think Hendrix, and not Preppy Boy here.  That''s probably it; I remember the 60''s, so my opinion almost certainly doesn''t matter to you anyway!  Actually I do like your shot of the lights, but the guy lacks a similar impact.  Sorry.  5</td>', 'It''s a striking visual effect but leaves me a bit disappointed.  Maybe it''s my age; when you say "Purple Haze" to me I think Hendrix, and not Preppy Boy here.  That''s probably it; I remember the 60''s, so my opinion almost certainly doesn''t matter to you anyway!  Actually I do like your shot of the lights, but the guy lacks a similar impact.  Sorry.  5', '2005-02-04 05:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150175, 141687, 30364, '<td valign="top">I feel I should like this more; you''ve gone to a lot of trouble &amp; also taken a technically good photograph.  However, it just seems a bit cold and staged to me (of course I do realise it''s not supposed to be a candid shot, but it still feels unconvincing anyway).  Plenty of style but not enough substance is what I''m trying to say.  I may well be in the minority, of course.  Sorry.  5</td>', 'I feel I should like this more; you''ve gone to a lot of trouble & also taken a technically good photograph.  However, it just seems a bit cold and staged to me (of course I do realise it''s not supposed to be a candid shot, but it still feels unconvincing anyway).  Plenty of style but not enough substance is what I''m trying to say.  I may well be in the minority, of course.  Sorry.  5', '2005-02-04 05:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150176, 140538, 30364, '<td valign="top">I feel that it''s a very nice picture but somehow lacks the dramatic element that makes me want to look at it a second time.  Maybe there''s a more visually arresting shot over closer to the lighthouse?  Getb the thing dominating the frame, maybe.  It looks like a potentially high-impact structure, but loses some presence peeping over the tops of some unremarkable trees.  Sorry.  5</td>', 'I feel that it''s a very nice picture but somehow lacks the dramatic element that makes me want to look at it a second time.  Maybe there''s a more visually arresting shot over closer to the lighthouse?  Getb the thing dominating the frame, maybe.  It looks like a potentially high-impact structure, but loses some presence peeping over the tops of some unremarkable trees.  Sorry.  5', '2005-02-04 05:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150180, 141898, 30364, '<td valign="top">Not my style, I''m afraid.  It looks like a poster for a cheesy fantasy movie.  The photograph is very good technically (except for the starburst, which I know of course was the entire point of your shot.)  I expect that you will get a lot more support from others, but for me, I''m afraid it''s a 5.</td>', 'Not my style, I''m afraid.  It looks like a poster for a cheesy fantasy movie.  The photograph is very good technically (except for the starburst, which I know of course was the entire point of your shot.)  I expect that you will get a lot more support from others, but for me, I''m afraid it''s a 5.', '2005-02-04 05:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150181, 141466, 30364, '<td valign="top">I see the effect you were after, of course, and it does make a nearly mesmerising image.  So you have every right to feel you succeeded.  I don''t find it an appealing or even interesting image, but that''s just my taste I guess.  The nose shadow seems to detract a bit; looks like a rectangualr hole in his head.  So, effective, but not for me.  Sorry.  5</td>', 'I see the effect you were after, of course, and it does make a nearly mesmerising image.  So you have every right to feel you succeeded.  I don''t find it an appealing or even interesting image, but that''s just my taste I guess.  The nose shadow seems to detract a bit; looks like a rectangualr hole in his head.  So, effective, but not for me.  Sorry.  5', '2005-02-04 05:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150184, 141391, 30364, '<td valign="top">It seems like you''ve taken a lot of trouble for minimal effect ... a confused mix of DP Challenge cliches, and alas it''s rather poorly composed, lit and photographed as well.  I''m afraid I can offer no more constructive advice than this:  go outside and take a real photograph of something.  Take plenty.  Leave this studio rubbish to the poor souls who revel in it.  Sorry.  4</td>', 'It seems like you''ve taken a lot of trouble for minimal effect ... a confused mix of DP Challenge cliches, and alas it''s rather poorly composed, lit and photographed as well.  I''m afraid I can offer no more constructive advice than this:  go outside and take a real photograph of something.  Take plenty.  Leave this studio rubbish to the poor souls who revel in it.  Sorry.  4', '2005-02-04 05:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150190, 139856, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a poor relation, I''m afraid.  Been done, several times, and been done better every time.  I''m afraid to me this one is just too incoherent to have any impact.  The candle is evident only after the most searching examination, and the bubbles are just too slipshod to achieve the repeating pattern upon which the intended effect depends.  Sorry. 4</td>', 'This is a poor relation, I''m afraid.  Been done, several times, and been done better every time.  I''m afraid to me this one is just too incoherent to have any impact.  The candle is evident only after the most searching examination, and the bubbles are just too slipshod to achieve the repeating pattern upon which the intended effect depends.  Sorry. 4', '2005-02-04 06:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150193, 141758, 5728, '<td valign="top">The referee looks a little bored out the back with his hands in his pocket :))) Good capture!</td>', 'The referee looks a little bored out the back with his hands in his pocket :))) Good capture!', '2005-02-04 06:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
