(1150230, 141658, 30364, '<td valign="top">Wonderful effort!  Waldo disguised as a light.  Your light may suck but your Cathedral is beautiful.  And the sunlight light is quite effective, especially on the (ruins?) to the left of shot.  5</td>', 'Wonderful effort!  Waldo disguised as a light.  Your light may suck but your Cathedral is beautiful.  And the sunlight light is quite effective, especially on the (ruins?) to the left of shot.  5', '2005-02-04 06:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150238, 140922, 30364, '<td valign="top">Thanks ... now I know how they make those highlight streaks in hair.  I must say they look better during this phase than they do when they''re finished.  The photo is OK; a bit overblown but I guess that''s deliberate?  I do find it hard to comment on a subject who''s head appears to have been prepared for the oven.  But at least you got my attention.  4</td>', 'Thanks ... now I know how they make those highlight streaks in hair.  I must say they look better during this phase than they do when they''re finished.  The photo is OK; a bit overblown but I guess that''s deliberate?  I do find it hard to comment on a subject who''s head appears to have been prepared for the oven.  But at least you got my attention.  4', '2005-02-04 07:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150241, 140161, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific photograph of two great human subjects.  The challenge is a bit of a stretch though.  The guitarist is using a capo; maybe he''s playing a light chord?   6</td>', 'Terrific photograph of two great human subjects.  The challenge is a bit of a stretch though.  The guitarist is using a capo; maybe he''s playing a light chord?   6', '2005-02-04 07:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150247, 141645, 30364, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of bulb shots in this challenge, which doesn''t make it a good idea; just popular.  This one is a little short of impact because it is neither lit up (I don''t know how they do that, either), nor is it photographed in an interesting way (in silhouette, for example).  I guess what I''m saying is that if you are going to shoot a pedestrian object, try to find an "unusual" way to do so.  Sorry.  4</td>', 'There are a lot of bulb shots in this challenge, which doesn''t make it a good idea; just popular.  This one is a little short of impact because it is neither lit up (I don''t know how they do that, either), nor is it photographed in an interesting way (in silhouette, for example).  I guess what I''m saying is that if you are going to shoot a pedestrian object, try to find an "unusual" way to do so.  Sorry.  4', '2005-02-04 07:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150261, 141518, 33148, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast!</td>', 'Nice contrast!', '2005-02-04 07:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150263, 140629, 25355, '<td valign="top">I see it''s gone out of business since Wile E. Coyote went into retirement.<br/>As for the photo, maybe there''s a bit too much foreground - you could crop off the road and you''d have the horizon abot a third of the way up.<br/>  I like it, anyway.</td>', 'I see it''s gone out of business since Wile E. Coyote went into retirement.As for the photo, maybe there''s a bit too much foreground - you could crop off the road and you''d have the horizon abot a third of the way up.  I like it, anyway.', '2005-02-04 07:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150267, 140881, 25355, '<td valign="top">Could this be in Japan?</td>', 'Could this be in Japan?', '2005-02-04 08:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150287, 140315, 23855, '<td valign="top">Great theme man.</td>', 'Great theme man.', '2005-02-04 08:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150379, 139856, 14735, '<td valign="top">I gave this a high score but would really like to have seen the light ring around the upper right drop gone. Good photo nice idea</td>', 'I gave this a high score but would really like to have seen the light ring around the upper right drop gone. Good photo nice idea', '2005-02-04 10:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150381, 141817, 14735, '<td valign="top">This plays with the light well. The reflection adds bits of color through out the photo</td>', 'This plays with the light well. The reflection adds bits of color through out the photo', '2005-02-04 10:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150383, 141122, 14735, '<td valign="top">The moody effect here is nice. The silhouette works well with the mist and adds to the clouds and contrails in the sky</td>', 'The moody effect here is nice. The silhouette works well with the mist and adds to the clouds and contrails in the sky', '2005-02-04 10:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150387, 141375, 14735, '<td valign="top">THe reflection in the light really set this photo off. Beautiful job</td>', 'THe reflection in the light really set this photo off. Beautiful job', '2005-02-04 10:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150391, 140479, 14735, '<td valign="top">I love B&amp;W for this challenge because all you hve are texture and light and your light is well set-up.</td>', 'I love B&W for this challenge because all you hve are texture and light and your light is well set-up.', '2005-02-04 10:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150393, 141663, 14735, '<td valign="top">This photo shows a lot of potential. The face of the child could have been softened up a bit though, right now it just looks a bit blurred. Could have used a different color candle that was more the color tone with his face.</td>', 'This photo shows a lot of potential. The face of the child could have been softened up a bit though, right now it just looks a bit blurred. Could have used a different color candle that was more the color tone with his face.', '2005-02-04 10:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150394, 141508, 14735, '<td valign="top">The face has too many strong shadows, it makes it look unnatural.  I am no lighting expert but maybe some side lighting on the face would help. Good idea though</td>', 'The face has too many strong shadows, it makes it look unnatural.  I am no lighting expert but maybe some side lighting on the face would help. Good idea though', '2005-02-04 10:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150398, 141526, 14735, '<td valign="top">I would have left this just B&amp;W. The color does not work for me or the light on the side of her face. It seems like a good photo other wise</td>', 'I would have left this just B&W. The color does not work for me or the light on the side of her face. It seems like a good photo other wise', '2005-02-04 10:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
