(1150574, 141902, 31172, '<td valign="top">This is another picture that is really cool but I think would be better if the background lights were cloned out.  These lights lead me thru the picture but the background pulls me away.  (7)<br/> <br/>Just came back for another look, I also see blue and yellow around the lights, a bit distracting also. Probably due to the jpg compression.</td>', 'This is another picture that is really cool but I think would be better if the background lights were cloned out.  These lights lead me thru the picture but the background pulls me away.  (7) Just came back for another look, I also see blue and yellow around the lights, a bit distracting also. Probably due to the jpg compression.', '2005-02-04 13:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
