(1150771, 141141, 30364, '<td valign="top">Niced photo of a giant eyeball, or UFO interior, or whatever it is.  How do the rods or cables fade into nothingness in the centre?  Anyway, it''s not a subject I''d choose, but it certainly eye-catching (sorry, couldn''t resist that).  It has got a "something''s missing" feel about it, though.  6</td>', 'Niced photo of a giant eyeball, or UFO interior, or whatever it is.  How do the rods or cables fade into nothingness in the centre?  Anyway, it''s not a subject I''d choose, but it certainly eye-catching (sorry, couldn''t resist that).  It has got a "something''s missing" feel about it, though.  6', '2005-02-04 15:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150786, 141818, 31865, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to see how you did this.  I''m thinking same lightbulb, long exposure. But it''s so crisp.  Very nice photo.</td>', 'I can''t wait to see how you did this.  I''m thinking same lightbulb, long exposure. But it''s so crisp.  Very nice photo.', '2005-02-04 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150787, 141775, 30364, '<td valign="top">I think you''re clever to have found a "natural" prism and to have composed a decent photograph to display it effectively. Nevertheless, it makes for an image that doesn''t stimulate any emotion or thought at all.  Once you''ve seen the light spectrum, that''s pretty much all there is.  Do you think a human figure, or even a fragment of one, might have added something, or maybe you felt it would have just distracted?  As it is, I''m stuck at a score of 6.</td>', 'I think you''re clever to have found a "natural" prism and to have composed a decent photograph to display it effectively. Nevertheless, it makes for an image that doesn''t stimulate any emotion or thought at all.  Once you''ve seen the light spectrum, that''s pretty much all there is.  Do you think a human figure, or even a fragment of one, might have added something, or maybe you felt it would have just distracted?  As it is, I''m stuck at a score of 6.', '2005-02-04 15:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150790, 140305, 14735, '<td valign="top">For me this type of photo would be better if the DOF was greater. The softer part at the bottom was a bit of a distraction.  6</td>', 'For me this type of photo would be better if the DOF was greater. The softer part at the bottom was a bit of a distraction.  6', '2005-02-04 15:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
