(1150799, 141045, 31865, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the blurriness of this makes it more or less appealing, but i really like the photo.  The contrast and tones are stunning.</td>', 'I''m not sure if the blurriness of this makes it more or less appealing, but i really like the photo.  The contrast and tones are stunning.', '2005-02-04 15:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150802, 141524, 30364, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, and you have effectively used the light to draw attention to the "blooms".  The dark thing (snake?  rope?) at lower left distracts me.  6</td>', 'Interesting subject, and you have effectively used the light to draw attention to the "blooms".  The dark thing (snake?  rope?) at lower left distracts me.  6', '2005-02-04 15:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150812, 141122, 31865, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo.  the only thing i would change is to crop the top a little more so that the branch in the foreground doesn''t show.  i think it''s a little distracting.  otherwise, very nice.</td>', 'beautiful photo.  the only thing i would change is to crop the top a little more so that the branch in the foreground doesn''t show.  i think it''s a little distracting.  otherwise, very nice.', '2005-02-04 15:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150823, 140227, 30364, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge and it''s a visually arresting composition; an interesting abstract feel to it.  But it doesn''t suggest anything deeper to me (doesn''t have to, of course, but I prefer some emotional dimension, a statement about the subject, rather than just a subject).  So this leaves me thinking, "That''s good, but that''s all".  Therefore ... 6.</td>', 'Meets the challenge and it''s a visually arresting composition; an interesting abstract feel to it.  But it doesn''t suggest anything deeper to me (doesn''t have to, of course, but I prefer some emotional dimension, a statement about the subject, rather than just a subject).  So this leaves me thinking, "That''s good, but that''s all".  Therefore ... 6.', '2005-02-04 15:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150827, 141798, 31865, '<td valign="top">the bottom third of this is my favorite part.  the golden color is brilliant.</td>', 'the bottom third of this is my favorite part.  the golden color is brilliant.', '2005-02-04 15:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150833, 139612, 31865, '<td valign="top">this would be a nice golf ball ad.  i love the simplicity and detail.</td>', 'this would be a nice golf ball ad.  i love the simplicity and detail.', '2005-02-04 15:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150836, 139856, 31865, '<td valign="top">i dont know what this is or how you did it, but i like it.</td>', 'i dont know what this is or how you did it, but i like it.', '2005-02-04 15:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150853, 140929, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is an elegant composition.  I especially like the extension of the lines of the model''s pose down through the left hand &amp; left foot.  And the light is of course very effective.  I think I''d have like it better with something visible in addition to the model, to provide some context (she seems like she''s floating in ink, to me).  However, no doubt you''d feel that a prop would compromise the purity of your image.  And you''d probably be right.  7</td>', 'This is an elegant composition.  I especially like the extension of the lines of the model''s pose down through the left hand & left foot.  And the light is of course very effective.  I think I''d have like it better with something visible in addition to the model, to provide some context (she seems like she''s floating in ink, to me).  However, no doubt you''d feel that a prop would compromise the purity of your image.  And you''d probably be right.  7', '2005-02-04 16:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150864, 140926, 30364, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide how you''ve done it.  Is it just camera motion?  Whatever, it''s technically very good, and visually startling.  And it satisfies the challenge well.  Having said all that, it triggers no emotions or even thoughts (other than, "How''d he/she do that?").  Lots of style but not much substance is what this image says to me.   Of course, that could be my problem, not yours!  6</td>', 'I can''t decide how you''ve done it.  Is it just camera motion?  Whatever, it''s technically very good, and visually startling.  And it satisfies the challenge well.  Having said all that, it triggers no emotions or even thoughts (other than, "How''d he/she do that?").  Lots of style but not much substance is what this image says to me.   Of course, that could be my problem, not yours!  6', '2005-02-04 16:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150883, 139612, 30364, '<td valign="top">Technically very good, and of course its challenge related qualities are excellent.  Maybe the starburst effect is a tiny bit overdone?  But no, maybe it''s just right.  There are a few small distractions visible in some of the dimples ... manufacturing irregularities?  Try switching to the Titleist Pro VI; great distance and nice smooth dimples.  Score 7</td>', 'Technically very good, and of course its challenge related qualities are excellent.  Maybe the starburst effect is a tiny bit overdone?  But no, maybe it''s just right.  There are a few small distractions visible in some of the dimples ... manufacturing irregularities?  Try switching to the Titleist Pro VI; great distance and nice smooth dimples.  Score 7', '2005-02-04 16:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150889, 141759, 31409, '<td valign="top">Love how the colurs blend in seamlessly.  The eye gets drawn to the star. A tranquil picture</td>', 'Love how the colurs blend in seamlessly.  The eye gets drawn to the star. A tranquil picture', '2005-02-04 16:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150892, 141783, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a harmonious scene, nicely composed and photographed.  For me, it captures not just the look and light of the imminent rain, but also suggests the feel and even the smell of it.  Highly evocative is what it is.  7</td>', 'This is a harmonious scene, nicely composed and photographed.  For me, it captures not just the look and light of the imminent rain, but also suggests the feel and even the smell of it.  Highly evocative is what it is.  7', '2005-02-04 16:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150893, 141816, 20679, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture and the light is very emotive</td>', 'Wonderful capture and the light is very emotive', '2005-02-04 16:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150899, 139620, 20679, '<td valign="top">The black and white works well with this as it is a study in shadow as much as light. Beautiful</td>', 'The black and white works well with this as it is a study in shadow as much as light. Beautiful', '2005-02-04 16:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150905, 141499, 20679, '<td valign="top">has a graphicfunk look about it! Very innovative and the flame is weel caught with the blue halo. Bumping up</td>', 'has a graphicfunk look about it! Very innovative and the flame is weel caught with the blue halo. Bumping up', '2005-02-04 16:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150908, 141881, 8860, '<td valign="top">Unusual view and  some nice ambient glow. Slightly too over-exposed which is a shame. Crop could have been tighter top and left.</td>', 'Unusual view and  some nice ambient glow. Slightly too over-exposed which is a shame. Crop could have been tighter top and left.', '2005-02-04 16:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150910, 141627, 15204, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.  I like the feather caught in mid air, against a natural background.  The white bird (I think it''s a bird) in the background is very distracting, unfortunately.</td>', 'Nice DOF.  I like the feather caught in mid air, against a natural background.  The white bird (I think it''s a bird) in the background is very distracting, unfortunately.', '2005-02-04 16:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150911, 141759, 20679, '<td valign="top">Back for comments - this is a work of pure art. The smoothness of the tones and the high key effect is extremely effective. Should do well...good luck!</td>', 'Back for comments - this is a work of pure art. The smoothness of the tones and the high key effect is extremely effective. Should do well...good luck!', '2005-02-04 16:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150914, 141593, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not a bad scene. Dodging/retouching looks a little obvious on the lighthouse unfortunately, but it''s a strong composition.</td>', 'Not a bad scene. Dodging/retouching looks a little obvious on the lighthouse unfortunately, but it''s a strong composition.', '2005-02-04 16:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150916, 141876, 8860, '<td valign="top">Despite a bland and unattractive scene this is actually quite effective (and tough to achieve in such bright conditions). Will probably be voted down though.</td>', 'Despite a bland and unattractive scene this is actually quite effective (and tough to achieve in such bright conditions). Will probably be voted down though.', '2005-02-04 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
