(1151016, 141609, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very appealing photograph.  The building is interesting and the shaft of sunlight is an irresistible beacon that drives the whole process of appreciation for the viewer.  Even when viewed as a thumbnail from a distance, so you can''t tell what it''s a photo of, it''s still a compelling image ... which just underlines the strength of the composition for me.  And up close, the longer I look the better it gets.  9<br/>Second Opinion:  My top choice for this challenge ... because it''s the most effective use of light to elevate an otherwise unremarkable subject into something special, and because of the very thoughtful &amp; precise composition  I feel this photograph rewards a few minutes digestion.  Let''s hope it doesn''t get overlooked in favour of the more flashy but less nutritional snacks on offer.  It''s a 10.</td>', 'This is a very appealing photograph.  The building is interesting and the shaft of sunlight is an irresistible beacon that drives the whole process of appreciation for the viewer.  Even when viewed as a thumbnail from a distance, so you can''t tell what it''s a photo of, it''s still a compelling image ... which just underlines the strength of the composition for me.  And up close, the longer I look the better it gets.  9Second Opinion:  My top choice for this challenge ... because it''s the most effective use of light to elevate an otherwise unremarkable subject into something special, and because of the very thoughtful & precise composition  I feel this photograph rewards a few minutes digestion.  Let''s hope it doesn''t get overlooked in favour of the more flashy but less nutritional snacks on offer.  It''s a 10.', '2005-02-04 18:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151021, 141818, 30214, '<td valign="top">are you who I think you are? excellent idea, very imaginative</td>', 'are you who I think you are? excellent idea, very imaginative', '2005-02-04 18:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151026, 141730, 30214, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot</td>', 'I like this a lot', '2005-02-04 18:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151037, 141623, 30214, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, the oversaturated colors of the light - not so sure</td>', 'Interesting idea, the oversaturated colors of the light - not so sure', '2005-02-04 18:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151041, 141367, 6999, '<td valign="top">Hm. I had something along the same lines myself, but didn''t upload it. Compositionally this is very strong, and there is a sense of atmosphere to the empty room. I think you''ve done a good job wiith the balance of exposure, in a near imposible situation, without taking obvious processing artefacts to a noticeable amount. The impression of haze around the window, the unevenness of it, bugs me just a little: I like the idea of it, but the non-regularity of it somehow makes it seem unsuited to the room, unnatural, almost, out of place. Unless of course that <i>is</i> a processing artefact :-)</td>', 'Hm. I had something along the same lines myself, but didn''t upload it. Compositionally this is very strong, and there is a sense of atmosphere to the empty room. I think you''ve done a good job wiith the balance of exposure, in a near imposible situation, without taking obvious processing artefacts to a noticeable amount. The impression of haze around the window, the unevenness of it, bugs me just a little: I like the idea of it, but the non-regularity of it somehow makes it seem unsuited to the room, unnatural, almost, out of place. Unless of course that is a processing artefact :-)', '2005-02-04 18:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151043, 141499, 30214, '<td valign="top">cool idea, and a technical marvel</td>', 'cool idea, and a technical marvel', '2005-02-04 18:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151044, 141572, 30214, '<td valign="top">cool idea</td>', 'cool idea', '2005-02-04 18:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151048, 141036, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s a spooky element ot this shot, which is very strong. The cropping seems arbitrary at top and bottom - bottom more so - I''d be interested to know your thinking about that: I wonder if you''ve tried too hard to keep both the ethereal sky and the hauntedness of the foreground pathway? The figures add a strong edge too - a sense of careful departure. Like this a lot.</td>', 'There''s a spooky element ot this shot, which is very strong. The cropping seems arbitrary at top and bottom - bottom more so - I''d be interested to know your thinking about that: I wonder if you''ve tried too hard to keep both the ethereal sky and the hauntedness of the foreground pathway? The figures add a strong edge too - a sense of careful departure. Like this a lot.', '2005-02-04 18:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151054, 141514, 6999, '<td valign="top">You title throws me: is this really moonlight? Looks like the looming of a distant city rather. I like the effect nevertheless. I don''t get a great deal from it though - against the starts the effect of the moving clouds is effective, but the horizon is a bit ordinary, and whilst obviously necessary to the shot, I''m left wanting more of something. 6</td>', 'You title throws me: is this really moonlight? Looks like the looming of a distant city rather. I like the effect nevertheless. I don''t get a great deal from it though - against the starts the effect of the moving clouds is effective, but the horizon is a bit ordinary, and whilst obviously necessary to the shot, I''m left wanting more of something. 6', '2005-02-04 18:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151060, 141515, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like the evident sharpness of a naturally blurry subject. Nicely executed, nicely composed - though I suspect many will think it''s centred because of the poitioning of the element; your composition makes the dark (of course a necessary companion to the light) just a strong a part of the shot.</td>', 'Like the evident sharpness of a naturally blurry subject. Nicely executed, nicely composed - though I suspect many will think it''s centred because of the poitioning of the element; your composition makes the dark (of course a necessary companion to the light) just a strong a part of the shot.', '2005-02-04 18:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
