(1151515, 140074, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice POV and good lighting. I do find the dark blades a bit distracting especially the one on the left. It draws my eye to it instead of the light. Still a good photograph.</td>', 'Nice POV and good lighting. I do find the dark blades a bit distracting especially the one on the left. It draws my eye to it instead of the light. Still a good photograph.', '2005-02-05 02:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151518, 141498, 17507, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is so completely bizarre. Was this really taken at midnight? I''m prepared to believe it, but I can''t make any sense of the light on the beach. I''m sure this will make the top 20 (at least as sure as can be) and I think it *should* make the top 10- but who knows. This is a great picture, but it may be too subtle for some voters. Who knows. Good luck! (9)</td>', 'The lighting here is so completely bizarre. Was this really taken at midnight? I''m prepared to believe it, but I can''t make any sense of the light on the beach. I''m sure this will make the top 20 (at least as sure as can be) and I think it *should* make the top 10- but who knows. This is a great picture, but it may be too subtle for some voters. Who knows. Good luck! (9)', '2005-02-05 02:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151519, 140161, 17507, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome picture. The juxtaposition of the snoozing senior with the mariachi dude is almost too much :)</td>', 'This is an awesome picture. The juxtaposition of the snoozing senior with the mariachi dude is almost too much :)', '2005-02-05 02:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
