(1151525, 141805, 17507, '<td valign="top">the subject seems to have a lot of potential, but it''s lacking any definable form. even with the title to give some hint, I really don''t know what I''m looking at. it''d be interesting to see this from another perspective.</td>', 'the subject seems to have a lot of potential, but it''s lacking any definable form. even with the title to give some hint, I really don''t know what I''m looking at. it''d be interesting to see this from another perspective.', '2005-02-05 03:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
