(1151703, 141676, 32602, '<td valign="top">Brilliant, pardon the pun. I would like to see this without the reflected bulbs, because I suspect they are a distraction, especilly the way they catch the spot of yellow light.</td>', 'Brilliant, pardon the pun. I would like to see this without the reflected bulbs, because I suspect they are a distraction, especilly the way they catch the spot of yellow light.', '2005-02-05 06:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151710, 141687, 32602, '<td valign="top">This is reminiscent of old movie posters.</td>', 'This is reminiscent of old movie posters.', '2005-02-05 06:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151713, 141063, 32602, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous portrait.</td>', 'Gorgeous portrait.', '2005-02-05 06:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151738, 141514, 23251, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.<br/>Well this is my pick for a Ribbon,  I just love the soft glow of this photo and the sharpness of the silhouetted trees.  If there was anything that I would improve it could be the levelling of the foreground but maybe it slopes that way naturally.  Congrats and I hope I''m somewhere near you at the end!</td>', 'Returning for comment.Well this is my pick for a Ribbon,  I just love the soft glow of this photo and the sharpness of the silhouetted trees.  If there was anything that I would improve it could be the levelling of the foreground but maybe it slopes that way naturally.  Congrats and I hope I''m somewhere near you at the end!', '2005-02-05 07:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151744, 139620, 23251, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.<br/>Stunning image and right up there with a chance to medal in my books.  The choice of B&amp;W is spot on.  The only thing I can see that could be improved on are a couple of blured spots, was that something on the lens at the time? I hope this does well for you.</td>', 'Returning for comment.Stunning image and right up there with a chance to medal in my books.  The choice of B&W is spot on.  The only thing I can see that could be improved on are a couple of blured spots, was that something on the lens at the time? I hope this does well for you.', '2005-02-05 07:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151746, 141876, 23251, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.<br/>While the painting with light has worked well it seems to be without any real purpose IMHO and leaves the photo without a focal point / subject.  The clarity is good and the lighting great.</td>', 'Returning for comment.While the painting with light has worked well it seems to be without any real purpose IMHO and leaves the photo without a focal point / subject.  The clarity is good and the lighting great.', '2005-02-05 07:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151748, 141829, 23251, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.<br/>A quite spactacular photo that I suppect would have been quite drab taken at any other time or weather conditions, shows a good eye and a great capture.  I do feel that some of the area above the tip of the building could have been cropped and it would be interesting to see it that way.  Congrats and I hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Returning for comment.A quite spactacular photo that I suppect would have been quite drab taken at any other time or weather conditions, shows a good eye and a great capture.  I do feel that some of the area above the tip of the building could have been cropped and it would be interesting to see it that way.  Congrats and I hope it does well for you.', '2005-02-05 07:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151752, 141593, 23251, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.<br/>A stunning photo and one of the better light house photos that I have seen so great capture and well done in being able to place yourself wll for the photo.  I would have liked to see the light house stand out a little more like the waves on the right, maybe it could have been dodged a little to brighten it.   I hope this photo does well for you.</td>', 'Returning for comment.A stunning photo and one of the better light house photos that I have seen so great capture and well done in being able to place yourself wll for the photo.  I would have liked to see the light house stand out a little more like the waves on the right, maybe it could have been dodged a little to brighten it.   I hope this photo does well for you.', '2005-02-05 07:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151756, 141518, 23251, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.<br/>A stunning model and great use of light.  I''m not sure if you lightened the white of her eye but it does look to bright IMHO compared to the rest of the photo.  Good capture.</td>', 'Returning for comment.A stunning model and great use of light.  I''m not sure if you lightened the white of her eye but it does look to bright IMHO compared to the rest of the photo.  Good capture.', '2005-02-05 07:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151758, 141682, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Good even sky and light on the bird is good.</td>', 'Very nice capture. Good even sky and light on the bird is good.', '2005-02-05 07:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151763, 141348, 23251, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.<br/>Nice idea and good use of the lights.  I think you will suffer from having a dark photo and no clear silhouette of the walker.  Many of the dpc voters do not have calibrated monitors and I fear they will not be able to see this well.  Good luck.</td>', 'Returning for comment.Nice idea and good use of the lights.  I think you will suffer from having a dark photo and no clear silhouette of the walker.  Many of the dpc voters do not have calibrated monitors and I fear they will not be able to see this well.  Good luck.', '2005-02-05 07:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151769, 141704, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. What a wonderful covered bridge in it''s design. Works very well for this challenge with the blown out light at the end of the bridge. I love the light entering from the sides and bottom. Great detail, you DOF was spot on. the natural color is a plus, I''m glad you did not b&amp;w this photograph. Great Job 10!<br/> <br/>BTW - I would love to see this same picture without the light at the end showing us what''s beyond. This bridge has a story, if you get a chance to take a picture of it again from this view with details at the end that would be great. Congratulations.<br/></td>', 'Very nice capture. What a wonderful covered bridge in it''s design. Works very well for this challenge with the blown out light at the end of the bridge. I love the light entering from the sides and bottom. Great detail, you DOF was spot on. the natural color is a plus, I''m glad you did not b&w this photograph. Great Job 10! BTW - I would love to see this same picture without the light at the end showing us what''s beyond. This bridge has a story, if you get a chance to take a picture of it again from this view with details at the end that would be great. Congratulations.', '2005-02-05 07:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151775, 141687, 23251, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.<br/>Great idea and use of props, light and shadow to to create an eerie feel.  Wish I had a willing model like her.  I only wish her right eye was also visable.  Well done &amp; Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comment.Great idea and use of props, light and shadow to to create an eerie feel.  Wish I had a willing model like her.  I only wish her right eye was also visable.  Well done & Bumping up.', '2005-02-05 07:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151780, 141898, 22970, '<td valign="top">I know some if not most will find you photograph great. I on the other hand have to be honest in the way I see it. If I take away the bright star effect in the left eye  I would of really liked the photograph. But with the star, which in my opinion is overpowering, takes away from your photograph. Without the star you have a great mood photograph with great lighting to the face and achieving great natural tones at the same time. But as stated above the star is really distracting for me. Because of that I score your photograph a 6, without the star I would of scored an 8. I know thats just my opinion and hope you respect it as I do your work. I hope others can see around the star effect and hope you do well in the challenge. Good luck!</td>', 'I know some if not most will find you photograph great. I on the other hand have to be honest in the way I see it. If I take away the bright star effect in the left eye  I would of really liked the photograph. But with the star, which in my opinion is overpowering, takes away from your photograph. Without the star you have a great mood photograph with great lighting to the face and achieving great natural tones at the same time. But as stated above the star is really distracting for me. Because of that I score your photograph a 6, without the star I would of scored an 8. I know thats just my opinion and hope you respect it as I do your work. I hope others can see around the star effect and hope you do well in the challenge. Good luck!', '2005-02-05 07:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151784, 141685, 23251, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.<br/>Firstly let me say what a lovely model with a great smile and expressive eyes.  There are a few things that I believe would help improve this photo. 1)  If you move the model away from the background it will help to blure the background and also lose the harsh shadow lines evident over her sholder and neck. 2) You may have tried for a soft focus but it looks like it is out of focus.  3)  The position of the candle in the extreme bottom corner does not really work IMHO maybe in this case it could have been cropped out or better positioned.  Still a nice photo and I hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Returning for comment.Firstly let me say what a lovely model with a great smile and expressive eyes.  There are a few things that I believe would help improve this photo. 1)  If you move the model away from the background it will help to blure the background and also lose the harsh shadow lines evident over her sholder and neck. 2) You may have tried for a soft focus but it looks like it is out of focus.  3)  The position of the candle in the extreme bottom corner does not really work IMHO maybe in this case it could have been cropped out or better positioned.  Still a nice photo and I hope it does well for you.', '2005-02-05 07:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151785, 140882, 22970, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery and you captured it well. I think it would of been more powerful if you would of cropped the bottom just above the people and applied a little usm 85/2/1 to bring out more contrast in the cliff edges. Good capture 7</td>', 'Beautiful scenery and you captured it well. I think it would of been more powerful if you would of cropped the bottom just above the people and applied a little usm 85/2/1 to bring out more contrast in the cliff edges. Good capture 7', '2005-02-05 08:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151788, 141514, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice color. I think I would of cropped a little more of the bottom out on having just a small amount of the silhouette ground leaving the trees.</td>', 'Nice color. I think I would of cropped a little more of the bottom out on having just a small amount of the silhouette ground leaving the trees.', '2005-02-05 08:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151789, 141687, 22970, '<td valign="top">Powerful picture working with B&amp;W and light. Great Job 9!</td>', 'Powerful picture working with B&W and light. Great Job 9!', '2005-02-05 08:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151791, 141790, 23251, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.<br/>Although there is a good contrast with the lights and the dark there dosen''t seem to be any reason for the lights to have been moved.  I think this could have been a very nice photo with the lights and the smoke without the movement.  Good eye seeing these lights though.</td>', 'Returning for comment.Although there is a good contrast with the lights and the dark there dosen''t seem to be any reason for the lights to have been moved.  I think this could have been a very nice photo with the lights and the smoke without the movement.  Good eye seeing these lights though.', '2005-02-05 08:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1151797, 140322, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very creative and don''t exactly know how you achieved this. Looks like a screen, but what ever it is it reflects light well. I like the light, the texture, and its abstract feel. Great Job 8</td>', 'Very creative and don''t exactly know how you achieved this. Looks like a screen, but what ever it is it reflects light well. I like the light, the texture, and its abstract feel. Great Job 8', '2005-02-05 08:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
