(1152088, 141821, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is very "pure" light and technically quite remarkable. Aesthetically, it''s not floating my boatd but I gave it a decent score because a lot of thought clearly went into it, and the result is remarkable in its own way.</td>', 'This is very "pure" light and technically quite remarkable. Aesthetically, it''s not floating my boatd but I gave it a decent score because a lot of thought clearly went into it, and the result is remarkable in its own way.', '2005-02-05 14:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152091, 141849, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting take on the challenge in a couple of ways: the light is self-contained, as it were, it''s an internal sort of glow, and the image itself is "heavy", not light. I admire the image on its own terms, and think it''s very well done. It does not make my top tier as an answer to the challenge, but I gave it a decent score. Very nice work.</td>', 'This is an interesting take on the challenge in a couple of ways: the light is self-contained, as it were, it''s an internal sort of glow, and the image itself is "heavy", not light. I admire the image on its own terms, and think it''s very well done. It does not make my top tier as an answer to the challenge, but I gave it a decent score. Very nice work.', '2005-02-05 14:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152093, 140319, 30861, '<td valign="top">A very intriguind effect, and well-directed to the challenge, but the image is marred IMO by very lackluster composition.</td>', 'A very intriguind effect, and well-directed to the challenge, but the image is marred IMO by very lackluster composition.', '2005-02-05 14:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152097, 141712, 30861, '<td valign="top">I was surprised to see so few "light through the trees" entries. This is the best of them, IMO. I am particularly taken by the wheelchair-bound individual on the left. I had originally ranked this as a 6, but a closer review as I go comment-writing has bumped it to a 7. Nice shot.</td>', 'I was surprised to see so few "light through the trees" entries. This is the best of them, IMO. I am particularly taken by the wheelchair-bound individual on the left. I had originally ranked this as a 6, but a closer review as I go comment-writing has bumped it to a 7. Nice shot.', '2005-02-05 14:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152101, 141318, 30861, '<td valign="top">An intrigoung composition. The water droplet, however, seems an unnecesary embellishment on an otherwsie puer concept. I''d have given it a 9 instead of a 7 if the droplet were not there.</td>', 'An intrigoung composition. The water droplet, however, seems an unnecesary embellishment on an otherwsie puer concept. I''d have given it a 9 instead of a 7 if the droplet were not there.', '2005-02-05 14:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
