(1152111, 139982, 30861, '<td valign="top">I quite like this. I suspect it will do very poorly, especially because a poorly-calibrated monitor willnot show the separation of branches and sky at the top. But I good score from me, and I admire the urge to post it despite its total deviation from what''s considered a "winning" approach in DPC.</td>', 'I quite like this. I suspect it will do very poorly, especially because a poorly-calibrated monitor willnot show the separation of branches and sky at the top. But I good score from me, and I admire the urge to post it despite its total deviation from what''s considered a "winning" approach in DPC.', '2005-02-05 14:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
