(1152173, 141789, 33112, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.....well done</td>', 'I love this picture.....well done', '2005-02-05 16:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152229, 140567, 18722, '<td valign="top">The points that I am sure you have heard already in the comments; image size is not using the allowed size of 640 pixels on a side and has a bit of a clockwise tilt.  The motion blur is so obvious I will assume it was intentional, and it certainly brings the focus of the image away from the building (as a building) and places it squarely on the lights.  A great way to meet the challenge topic head on.  However, abstracting the building in this way leaves you with composition only to produce an effect -- and it is a bit heavy on the right hand side.  The large bright area in the lower right out weights the rest of the image -- I believe placing more negative space on the right and less on the left would have produced a better composed image.</td>', 'The points that I am sure you have heard already in the comments; image size is not using the allowed size of 640 pixels on a side and has a bit of a clockwise tilt.  The motion blur is so obvious I will assume it was intentional, and it certainly brings the focus of the image away from the building (as a building) and places it squarely on the lights.  A great way to meet the challenge topic head on.  However, abstracting the building in this way leaves you with composition only to produce an effect -- and it is a bit heavy on the right hand side.  The large bright area in the lower right out weights the rest of the image -- I believe placing more negative space on the right and less on the left would have produced a better composed image.', '2005-02-05 16:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152234, 141817, 18722, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge well -- reflected light, bubbles lighter than water and a light ripple  on the surface -- but the image is busy and I am not finding a definite subject to focus upon.</td>', 'It meets the challenge well -- reflected light, bubbles lighter than water and a light ripple  on the surface -- but the image is busy and I am not finding a definite subject to focus upon.', '2005-02-05 16:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152240, 141156, 18722, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challange, and must have taken a lot of patience and practice to get it right.  There are really only two things I find distracting about it; the letters are all bunched together, overlapping in some places and the weight of the image is too much off to one side, the left.</td>', 'Great idea for the challange, and must have taken a lot of patience and practice to get it right.  There are really only two things I find distracting about it; the letters are all bunched together, overlapping in some places and the weight of the image is too much off to one side, the left.', '2005-02-05 17:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152242, 141897, 3102, '<td valign="top">The border seems to clash with this quite a bit, I''m afraid...</td>', 'The border seems to clash with this quite a bit, I''m afraid...', '2005-02-05 17:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
