(1152248, 141532, 18722, '<td valign="top">The light, red reflections on the glass, are good; but the image is too dark.  The details are all bunched up on the left-side of the histogram, and loses a lot of detail.  I think it would have been better if you had not rotated the image as well.</td>', 'The light, red reflections on the glass, are good; but the image is too dark.  The details are all bunched up on the left-side of the histogram, and loses a lot of detail.  I think it would have been better if you had not rotated the image as well.', '2005-02-05 17:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
