(1153065, 141391, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''ll give you an A for effort!  please take all comments for what they are, and don''t take them personally.  i think it is so cool for you to be trying this.  the main thing is, no matter how it scores or whatever comments you get, keep on trying new things.  learn how to use your camera and keep on pushing your imagination.  good luck!</td>', 'i''ll give you an A for effort!  please take all comments for what they are, and don''t take them personally.  i think it is so cool for you to be trying this.  the main thing is, no matter how it scores or whatever comments you get, keep on trying new things.  learn how to use your camera and keep on pushing your imagination.  good luck!', '2005-02-06 08:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
