(1153168, 141561, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph keeping the snow white and you used a good SS to not blur the water to much. It gives it texture with the soft smooth snow. Good composition and I like the low point of view. I would of liked to see a deeper DOF so that the rocks and water in the foreground would of been more focused. But still a great Shot 8.</td>', 'Nice photograph keeping the snow white and you used a good SS to not blur the water to much. It gives it texture with the soft smooth snow. Good composition and I like the low point of view. I would of liked to see a deeper DOF so that the rocks and water in the foreground would of been more focused. But still a great Shot 8.', '2005-02-06 11:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153170, 141818, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice effect and good job with focus, DOF, and lighting. Good Job 6</td>', 'Nice effect and good job with focus, DOF, and lighting. Good Job 6', '2005-02-06 11:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
