(1153172, 140926, 31133, '<td valign="top">Intriguing shot! The light going up to the feathers looks almost like the trunk and branches of a tree.  The blue and the yellowish feather look a little too bright or over-saturated, but that could just be me. The orange-ish feather looks perfect.</td>', 'Intriguing shot! The light going up to the feathers looks almost like the trunk and branches of a tree.  The blue and the yellowish feather look a little too bright or over-saturated, but that could just be me. The orange-ish feather looks perfect.', '2005-02-06 11:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
