(1153553, 141678, 6349, '<td valign="top">The refracted light is captured well here so that means you have a good angle and setup.  The photo itself, however, seems to have been heavily editied.  It no longer looks anything like a photo and the jewelry looks like a drawing of cheap plastic, thus taking away from the magic of the light.</td>', 'The refracted light is captured well here so that means you have a good angle and setup.  The photo itself, however, seems to have been heavily editied.  It no longer looks anything like a photo and the jewelry looks like a drawing of cheap plastic, thus taking away from the magic of the light.', '2005-02-06 16:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
