(1153736, 141057, 21362, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. Not terribly appealing to me personally, but I could see it being an effective image to be hung in a gym or whatnot. Maybe in a serious with a few other similar shots. Well done.</td>', 'Nice lighting. Not terribly appealing to me personally, but I could see it being an effective image to be hung in a gym or whatnot. Maybe in a serious with a few other similar shots. Well done.', '2005-02-06 20:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
