(1153772, 141008, 28619, '<td valign="top">The blue bit at the bottom of the globe spoils the effect of the ''rings'' a little.  I would have preferred a tighter crop personally.<br/> <br/>Other than that, very nicely done. 7</td>', 'The blue bit at the bottom of the globe spoils the effect of the ''rings'' a little.  I would have preferred a tighter crop personally. Other than that, very nicely done. 7', '2005-02-06 21:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153777, 141260, 28619, '<td valign="top">The frame looks a bit ''dirty'' to me.  Now I''m sure it''s not that bad really, but for this kind of shot I think everything needs to be scrupulously clean to achieve the intended effect.<br/> <br/>If it weren''t for that little niggle I''d go 7,as it is a 5.</td>', 'The frame looks a bit ''dirty'' to me.  Now I''m sure it''s not that bad really, but for this kind of shot I think everything needs to be scrupulously clean to achieve the intended effect. If it weren''t for that little niggle I''d go 7,as it is a 5.', '2005-02-06 21:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153784, 141110, 28619, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this comes across a bit dull to me in both senses of the word.  I can see what you were going for here, the backlit effect, but it just doesn''t work.  There is little colour and the shapes and textures are not enough to hold interest.  The centred subject does no favours either. 3.</td>', 'Sorry, but this comes across a bit dull to me in both senses of the word.  I can see what you were going for here, the backlit effect, but it just doesn''t work.  There is little colour and the shapes and textures are not enough to hold interest.  The centred subject does no favours either. 3.', '2005-02-06 21:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153790, 141778, 28619, '<td valign="top">Bit blown out at the top there.  I would have preferred to see more of the the rocks at the bottom as the light there looks great. 5.</td>', 'Bit blown out at the top there.  I would have preferred to see more of the the rocks at the bottom as the light there looks great. 5.', '2005-02-06 21:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
