(1153828, 141755, 16488, '<td valign="top">Very Impressionistic!<br/> <br/>(There''s a Beaver Lake near Syracuse, NY (Baldwinsville) but I doubt this is that, given the season.)<br/> <br/>Yes! You have pretty light!  Something not quite there in the presentation, but I do believe it is there in the photo--you might have to dig it out.<br/> <br/>(Edit for miserable spelling._<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-07 09:35:30.</i></td>', 'Very Impressionistic! (There''s a Beaver Lake near Syracuse, NY (Baldwinsville) but I doubt this is that, given the season.) Yes! You have pretty light!  Something not quite there in the presentation, but I do believe it is there in the photo--you might have to dig it out. (Edit for miserable spelling._', '2005-02-06 22:35:36.000000', '2005-02-07 09:35:30.000000', 1),
