(1154096, 140882, 19936, '<td valign="top">Wow, 4th place!  Thanks for all the comments and suggestions for making this a better shot.  I went to Deception Pass that foggy morning and spent over three hours waiting for the sun to burn through.  I was actually looking for a more dramatic shot that happens there with the fog swirling and the light rays coming through.  When these kayakers came by I liked the contrast so took the shot.  Never expected to do so well.  Thanks to all.</td>', 'Wow, 4th place!  Thanks for all the comments and suggestions for making this a better shot.  I went to Deception Pass that foggy morning and spent over three hours waiting for the sun to burn through.  I was actually looking for a more dramatic shot that happens there with the fog swirling and the light rays coming through.  When these kayakers came by I liked the contrast so took the shot.  Never expected to do so well.  Thanks to all.', '2005-02-07 00:43:35.000000', NULL, 0),
