(1154164, 141847, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely framed, stephanie.  can''t imagine what would make this better, except to have had a person sitting on one of the benches, waiting and watching.  (i carry around a very compact table-top tripod that''s 6.5" tall.  from the ground, you get some pretty interesting perspectives, and, with a remote release, you can be your own model...).  all the same, good work, keep it up!</td>', 'nicely framed, stephanie.  can''t imagine what would make this better, except to have had a person sitting on one of the benches, waiting and watching.  (i carry around a very compact table-top tripod that''s 6.5" tall.  from the ground, you get some pretty interesting perspectives, and, with a remote release, you can be your own model...).  all the same, good work, keep it up!', '2005-02-07 01:06:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1154168, 141564, 22384, '<td valign="top">Skiprow,<br/>Bravo on a daring and beautiful shot. It is unique and stunning. The comments say it all! What really blows me away is that you only cropped this!!! Now, this is art. It truly transcends. I, as always, stand in awe! <br/>Kathy</td>', 'Skiprow,Bravo on a daring and beautiful shot. It is unique and stunning. The comments say it all! What really blows me away is that you only cropped this!!! Now, this is art. It truly transcends. I, as always, stand in awe! Kathy', '2005-02-07 01:07:35.000000', NULL, 0),
