(1154181, 141784, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent work, neil, as well as under-appreciated!  don''t sweat the scores below 4--that''s typical, and not really worth consideration.<br/> <br/>the only thing i''d suggest your doing with this is to revisit your image and try various differing crops to see if there is a more powerful presentation of the imagery you''ve captured.  you''ve got a very strong foundation image to work with, and there might be any number of treatments that could work well.  keep up the great work!</td>', 'excellent work, neil, as well as under-appreciated!  don''t sweat the scores below 4--that''s typical, and not really worth consideration. the only thing i''d suggest your doing with this is to revisit your image and try various differing crops to see if there is a more powerful presentation of the imagery you''ve captured.  you''ve got a very strong foundation image to work with, and there might be any number of treatments that could work well.  keep up the great work!', '2005-02-07 01:13:07.000000', NULL, 0),
