(1154236, 139894, 28108, '<td valign="top">Hey! Nice to see you''re behind this beautiful shot, I''m really happy for you, and a bit envious too. That was one of my favorite shots, it should have been higher. Congradulation man! You are really improving. You love shooting, it shows and it pays off. Good luck with your next ones!<br/> <br/>-Simon<br/> <br/>P.S. Try to get a band to use this as an album cover. Even if you would have to crop out the left part to square it, it would still look great.</td>', 'Hey! Nice to see you''re behind this beautiful shot, I''m really happy for you, and a bit envious too. That was one of my favorite shots, it should have been higher. Congradulation man! You are really improving. You love shooting, it shows and it pays off. Good luck with your next ones! -Simon P.S. Try to get a band to use this as an album cover. Even if you would have to crop out the left part to square it, it would still look great.', '2005-02-07 01:30:59.000000', NULL, 0),
