(1154313, 141211, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice work, june, albeit grossly under-appreciated.  i really like the framing.  you might consider revisiting the post-processing, just to see what happens by playing with the hue/saturization and the color balances.  something might pop that may give a bit more of a powerful presentation of this lovely image.  good work, keep it up!</td>', 'nice work, june, albeit grossly under-appreciated.  i really like the framing.  you might consider revisiting the post-processing, just to see what happens by playing with the hue/saturization and the color balances.  something might pop that may give a bit more of a powerful presentation of this lovely image.  good work, keep it up!', '2005-02-07 02:11:21.000000', NULL, 0),
