(1154384, 141156, 16046, '<td valign="top">I used a lighted make-up mirror,11 seconds to write with, I tired many times to "dot" the I, finally got as close as I could. The make-up mirror has both sides lit, so I had to cover one side or you would be able to see part of me. It was fun.</td>', 'I used a lighted make-up mirror,11 seconds to write with, I tired many times to "dot" the I, finally got as close as I could. The make-up mirror has both sides lit, so I had to cover one side or you would be able to see part of me. It was fun.', '2005-02-07 03:21:14.000000', NULL, 0),
