(1154648, 141876, 12311, '<td valign="top">For those who asked...  It took only 6 tries to get this "right" (...although that''s a relative term :-)). I didn''t begin producing the image until about 3 hours before the deadline.  It was a pure experiment, with no illusions as to how it would be received.  It certainly won''t hang on anyone''s wall! LOL  It was just plain fun, ...but more practically, this gives me the confidence to use the technique in more "artsy" endeavours.  Thanks for all your comments!!<br/> <br/>-len</td>', 'For those who asked...  It took only 6 tries to get this "right" (...although that''s a relative term :-)). I didn''t begin producing the image until about 3 hours before the deadline.  It was a pure experiment, with no illusions as to how it would be received.  It certainly won''t hang on anyone''s wall! LOL  It was just plain fun, ...but more practically, this gives me the confidence to use the technique in more "artsy" endeavours.  Thanks for all your comments!! -len', '2005-02-07 08:29:20.000000', NULL, 0),
