(1154714, 140315, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok...I''m here because I wanted to see what the fuss was about (your thread ''Unfair voting'').  I think the composition is ok, the lighting is good, and the focus/detail is right on.  I do tend to agree with another commenter ''arpita'' that the first place the eyes wander to is the face and facial hair (she had a typo - sutblle).  The feather seems like a secondary subject.  Not sure that I have any suggestions on how it could have composed differently...sorry.  I am curious to see if you find my comment helpful, seeing as you didn''t find the comment from ''arpita'' worthy.  Was it because hers was negative?</td>', 'Ok...I''m here because I wanted to see what the fuss was about (your thread ''Unfair voting'').  I think the composition is ok, the lighting is good, and the focus/detail is right on.  I do tend to agree with another commenter ''arpita'' that the first place the eyes wander to is the face and facial hair (she had a typo - sutblle).  The feather seems like a secondary subject.  Not sure that I have any suggestions on how it could have composed differently...sorry.  I am curious to see if you find my comment helpful, seeing as you didn''t find the comment from ''arpita'' worthy.  Was it because hers was negative?', '2005-02-07 09:34:11.000000', NULL, 0),
