(1155134, 141566, 31637, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo jon. I think the man in the photo would of been better off sitting on a bench at any side of the chapel. It is sort of distracting. I like how the light radiates from the front to the back. very nice tones and hues, and the levels are perfect.</td>', 'beautiful photo jon. I think the man in the photo would of been better off sitting on a bench at any side of the chapel. It is sort of distracting. I like how the light radiates from the front to the back. very nice tones and hues, and the levels are perfect.', '2005-02-07 14:08:30.000000', NULL, 0),
