(1155300, 141498, 23251, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your great comments, I do appreciate them.  <br/> <br/>I think the lights are a special colour that does not interfear with the baby sea turtles when they hatch.  They hatch on a moonlight night and use the moon to find the water, if the lights are to bright they find the road instead.<br/> <br/>I''m very proud of this photo and the series.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for your great comments, I do appreciate them.   I think the lights are a special colour that does not interfear with the baby sea turtles when they hatch.  They hatch on a moonlight night and use the moon to find the water, if the lights are to bright they find the road instead. I''m very proud of this photo and the series.', '2005-02-07 15:30:27.000000', NULL, 0),
