(1156263, 141895, 9668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Imagineer:</b></div><hr/><i> Well done on snatching the F717 top spot too. What a fluke.<br/>; ) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I''d been watching my score all week according to that 7.69, I was on the border for most of the week: Low point - 173 votes: 7.6416. High point - 23 votes: 8.3478. I was at a 7.69 for most of the final day, but the last 10 votes/bumps realed me into a ending score of 7.7459 (244 votes), adjusted to a 7.764 final score.</td>', 'Originally posted by Imagineer: Well done on snatching the F717 top spot too. What a fluke.; )  I''d been watching my score all week according to that 7.69, I was on the border for most of the week: Low point - 173 votes: 7.6416. High point - 23 votes: 8.3478. I was at a 7.69 for most of the final day, but the last 10 votes/bumps realed me into a ending score of 7.7459 (244 votes), adjusted to a 7.764 final score.', '2005-02-07 23:16:23.000000', NULL, 0),
