(1162063, 141895, 16046, '<td valign="top">You have to be very proud of this image, I would like to see this on a cover of a photo magazine, I suggest you submit to Outdoor Photographer and others, I''m sure they would love it as well. Now I want to head down to the Oregon coast for a few days. Thanks for sharing.<br/> <br/>Frank<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-11 06:23:49.</i></td>', 'You have to be very proud of this image, I would like to see this on a cover of a photo magazine, I suggest you submit to Outdoor Photographer and others, I''m sure they would love it as well. Now I want to head down to the Oregon coast for a few days. Thanks for sharing. Frank', '2005-02-10 17:16:44.000000', '2005-02-11 06:23:49.000000', 0),
(1163100, 141175, 27137, '<td valign="top">well  done!</td>', 'well  done!', '2005-02-11 05:33:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1163437, 141712, 32117, '<td valign="top">nice one dear!!!!<br/>the pic is really picturisque!</td>', 'nice one dear!!!!the pic is really picturisque!', '2005-02-11 11:28:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1163441, 141712, 32117, '<td valign="top">nice 1!</td>', 'nice 1!', '2005-02-11 11:31:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1163467, 140578, 32117, '<td valign="top">hey did u use that star burst thing???</td>', 'hey did u use that star burst thing???', '2005-02-11 11:47:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1164033, 141895, 22872, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  I went and looked at your website and you have some awesome pictures!  I''m from Oregon (moved to Florida in 98) and I used to go to Bandon all the time....  your photos make me terribly homesick :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love this picture.  I went and looked at your website and you have some awesome pictures!  I''m from Oregon (moved to Florida in 98) and I used to go to Bandon all the time....  your photos make me terribly homesick :) ', '2005-02-11 17:31:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1164275, 141783, 714, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. Congrats.</td>', 'This is beautiful. Congrats.', '2005-02-11 20:08:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1164319, 141895, 23944, '<td valign="top">God! I hate you!!! You''re so good! seriously mate, awsome pic, love it!</td>', 'God! I hate you!!! You''re so good! seriously mate, awsome pic, love it!', '2005-02-11 20:42:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1164812, 141175, 23458, '<td valign="top">Now this is seriously underrated. Great comedy and execution.</td>', 'Now this is seriously underrated. Great comedy and execution.', '2005-02-12 08:19:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1165661, 141146, 17103, '<td valign="top">Kylie, I appreciate the thought, but I feel good about my final score.  A 6.4 isn''t too shabby.  But thanks again! :)</td>', 'Kylie, I appreciate the thought, but I feel good about my final score.  A 6.4 isn''t too shabby.  But thanks again! :)', '2005-02-12 20:37:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1165898, 141895, 33600, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good work! \m/</td>', 'Very nice, good work! \m/', '2005-02-13 01:16:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1166049, 141728, 24546, '<td valign="top">Critique Club- Your composition here is very nice - your glass is nicely offcentered and the lines from the laser light help lead your eye through the photo.  I also like the way background flows from the blue into the reds.  Very nice job!</td>', 'Critique Club- Your composition here is very nice - your glass is nicely offcentered and the lines from the laser light help lead your eye through the photo.  I also like the way background flows from the blue into the reds.  Very nice job!', '2005-02-13 07:25:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1166050, 139874, 24546, '<td valign="top">This one is stunning!  I really like how well the sides of the glass  mirror each other. From a composition standpoint- great use of lines the edges of the glass really lead your eye through the photo.  Great use of lighting and color!  Great job!</td>', 'This one is stunning!  I really like how well the sides of the glass  mirror each other. From a composition standpoint- great use of lines the edges of the glass really lead your eye through the photo.  Great use of lighting and color!  Great job!', '2005-02-13 07:29:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1166089, 141122, 5728, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the placing, it''s a beautiful shot!</td>', 'Congrats on the placing, it''s a beautiful shot!', '2005-02-13 09:03:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1166091, 141783, 5728, '<td valign="top">Way to go, well done Ed!</td>', 'Way to go, well done Ed!', '2005-02-13 09:04:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1166318, 141895, 33615, '<td valign="top">Incredible.  Thanks for taking me there for a moment.  I loved the trip.  (new to this site -- I''m gonna love it here aren''t I?)</td>', 'Incredible.  Thanks for taking me there for a moment.  I loved the trip.  (new to this site -- I''m gonna love it here aren''t I?)', '2005-02-13 13:43:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1166809, 141122, 33544, '<td valign="top">excellent. congrats on a great job</td>', 'excellent. congrats on a great job', '2005-02-13 21:05:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1167407, 141564, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great shot Skip--this was one of my top 10 for the challenge.  I like the white on white and of course the lovely motion blur!</td>', 'Great shot Skip--this was one of my top 10 for the challenge.  I like the white on white and of course the lovely motion blur!', '2005-02-14 01:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1170101, 141885, 22479, '<td valign="top">Challenge was for any definition of the word "light", which I think this qualifies perfectly. Seriously underrated photograph.</td>', 'Challenge was for any definition of the word "light", which I think this qualifies perfectly. Seriously underrated photograph.', '2005-02-14 23:24:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1170113, 141518, 22479, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic portrait. It''s interesting how some identify the ''eye on the left side'' as the left eye (actually being the right eye).</td>', 'What a fantastic portrait. It''s interesting how some identify the ''eye on the left side'' as the left eye (actually being the right eye).', '2005-02-14 23:29:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1174654, 141709, 3724, '<td valign="top">Even with the blown highlights - I like the contrast, this is a great cat portrait  fyi: voted 9</td>', 'Even with the blown highlights - I like the contrast, this is a great cat portrait  fyi: voted 9', '2005-02-16 13:30:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1177898, 141417, 8054, '<td valign="top">That''s a great shot, Arie! Love the strong contrast and the way it looks desaturated. I wish there was some eyeball space to his right as he feels slightly confined within the frame and borderline too centered. Maybe there was extra stuff that was too distracting on that side (his right). Great job, otherwise!</td>', 'That''s a great shot, Arie! Love the strong contrast and the way it looks desaturated. I wish there was some eyeball space to his right as he feels slightly confined within the frame and borderline too centered. Maybe there was extra stuff that was too distracting on that side (his right). Great job, otherwise!', '2005-02-17 15:35:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1179082, 141849, 31637, '<td valign="top">no way should this have scored so low. I gave this an 8. It probably would of scored high in the self portrait challenge.</td>', 'no way should this have scored so low. I gave this an 8. It probably would of scored high in the self portrait challenge.', '2005-02-18 00:29:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1182837, 141478, 14986, '<td valign="top">This would make a really cool print.  I would have cropped out just a bit of the sun orb at the top.  I like having the sun there, but not quite that much.  The mountain scenery in the background just makes this shot.  Wonderful opportunity for a great shot here and I''m glad you took advantage of it and shared it!</td>', 'This would make a really cool print.  I would have cropped out just a bit of the sun orb at the top.  I like having the sun there, but not quite that much.  The mountain scenery in the background just makes this shot.  Wonderful opportunity for a great shot here and I''m glad you took advantage of it and shared it!', '2005-02-19 20:22:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1183208, 141895, 14986, '<td valign="top">Just added this one to my favorites.  Wow.  Awesome color, composition, and mood to this beautiful shot.  You have nailed the sunlight and brought out all the reflections and beach interest as well.  I agree with someone below who said this needs to be on a magazine cover.  You really should be entering this everyplace you can!<br/> <br/>Congratulations for being the one God chose to click the shutter on this one :o)</td>', 'Just added this one to my favorites.  Wow.  Awesome color, composition, and mood to this beautiful shot.  You have nailed the sunlight and brought out all the reflections and beach interest as well.  I agree with someone below who said this needs to be on a magazine cover.  You really should be entering this everyplace you can! Congratulations for being the one God chose to click the shutter on this one :o)', '2005-02-19 23:50:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1183352, 140587, 1054, '<td valign="top">This is a nice sunset, but has a bit of an overprocessed feel to it. My guess (and I could be wrong) is that this was a touch underexposed and brought up via levels in post-processing. Either way this is a very good photograph, but probably could have been improved by a slightly longer exposure out of camera.</td>', 'This is a nice sunset, but has a bit of an overprocessed feel to it. My guess (and I could be wrong) is that this was a touch underexposed and brought up via levels in post-processing. Either way this is a very good photograph, but probably could have been improved by a slightly longer exposure out of camera.', '2005-02-20 03:09:43.000000', NULL, 0);
