(1284438, 141122, 35472, '<td valign="top">beautiful! just great. have you tryed to remove frame, it''s some kind of extra or something... anyway great job!</td>', 'beautiful! just great. have you tryed to remove frame, it''s some kind of extra or something... anyway great job!', '2005-04-11 16:32:10.000000', NULL, 0),
