(1403056, 141353, 36141, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments on my photo''s.<br/>I like this flying free bird very much, perfect capture of freedom.</td>', 'Thanks for your comments on my photo''s.I like this flying free bird very much, perfect capture of freedom.', '2005-05-21 22:27:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1403251, 141608, 37005, '<td valign="top">I like the expansiveness of this photo.  I like the red light being the only color.</td>', 'I like the expansiveness of this photo.  I like the red light being the only color.', '2005-05-22 00:47:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1403838, 141375, 36888, '<td valign="top">Concept: Interesting, but muddled with flaws of the subject: glare spots, floor distracting from main reflection <br/>Center focus: Too busy to remain interesting. <br/>Challenge: I cannot see it-light is not even dramatic<br/>Composition: Centered focus, poor crop. <br/>Sorry, I just have nothing really good to say about this image.</td>', 'Concept: Interesting, but muddled with flaws of the subject: glare spots, floor distracting from main reflection Center focus: Too busy to remain interesting. Challenge: I cannot see it-light is not even dramaticComposition: Centered focus, poor crop. Sorry, I just have nothing really good to say about this image.', '2005-05-22 13:28:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1420609, 141758, 31203, '<td valign="top">It was a sad day at DPC for me when my photo was challenged and disqualified.  I only used the above methods to enhance the light shining on the boxer''s face.  Remember, guys and gals, this IS digital photography and more creativity should be allowed.</td>', 'It was a sad day at DPC for me when my photo was challenged and disqualified.  I only used the above methods to enhance the light shining on the boxer''s face.  Remember, guys and gals, this IS digital photography and more creativity should be allowed.', '2005-05-30 10:58:16.000000', NULL, 0),
