(1480762, 141512, 15711, '<td valign="top">Just lovely. The soft sepia is perfect for this shot. Has a very wistful quality to it.</td>', 'Just lovely. The soft sepia is perfect for this shot. Has a very wistful quality to it.', '2005-06-24 10:12:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1481755, 141663, 16488, '<td valign="top">Just so you know, I gave this an 8.  I liked the isolation of the face with the candlelight.  I approve of your (sacriligeous?) title.  The soft focus, expression, character of the image are all so pleasing to me.</td>', 'Just so you know, I gave this an 8.  I liked the isolation of the face with the candlelight.  I approve of your (sacriligeous?) title.  The soft focus, expression, character of the image are all so pleasing to me.', '2005-06-24 17:55:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1490720, 141870, 39664, '<td valign="top">She looks like "You wanna piece of me?"  Makes her look harsh and weathered.  Also, a distraction for me is her chain.  The clasp is showing.  If you are attempting a beauty shot, limit accessories because they aren''t what you are supposed to be looking at.</td>', 'She looks like "You wanna piece of me?"  Makes her look harsh and weathered.  Also, a distraction for me is her chain.  The clasp is showing.  If you are attempting a beauty shot, limit accessories because they aren''t what you are supposed to be looking at.', '2005-06-29 10:21:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1495169, 141796, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the glowing colors.  Great close up.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the glowing colors.  Great close up.', '2005-06-30 14:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1500686, 141778, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the dappled light in the foreground.  The icicles are a nice touch.  Very vertical image. I find it lovely.</td>', 'I love the dappled light in the foreground.  The icicles are a nice touch.  Very vertical image. I find it lovely.', '2005-07-02 22:27:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1529474, 141321, 37961, '<td valign="top">Ignore all the negative comments. :) It''s a lovely photo and captured just the way you wanted it. Her lips, skin tone and hint of hair on the right are done perfectly to my tastes. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Ignore all the negative comments. :) It''s a lovely photo and captured just the way you wanted it. Her lips, skin tone and hint of hair on the right are done perfectly to my tastes.  ', '2005-07-12 10:30:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1562416, 141876, 15711, '<td valign="top">THIS IS SO COOL.  I love it.  I don''t think my camera has those capabilities, but this is something fun to aspire to.  Good job.</td>', 'THIS IS SO COOL.  I love it.  I don''t think my camera has those capabilities, but this is something fun to aspire to.  Good job.', '2005-07-25 18:35:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1563174, 141514, 36563, '<td valign="top">Eeeee! I love that song!! "By the light of the moon, he''s a frenchman for the night, by the light of the moon, it''ll be alright"<br/> <br/>One of my favorite Jimmy Buffet songs!!<br/> <br/>Oh and awesome picture by the way!</td>', 'Eeeee! I love that song!! "By the light of the moon, he''s a frenchman for the night, by the light of the moon, it''ll be alright" One of my favorite Jimmy Buffet songs!! Oh and awesome picture by the way!', '2005-07-26 00:45:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1623358, 141843, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  The colors are very nice.  The amount of foreground detail is great.  The lighthouse is perfectly positioned in the shot.  Great job!</td>', 'Very nice shot!  The colors are very nice.  The amount of foreground detail is great.  The lighthouse is perfectly positioned in the shot.  Great job!', '2005-08-19 08:53:23.000000', NULL, 0),
