(1767484, 140322, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent catch of the heart shape!  Very cool. <br/> <br/>I am sure if DPC allowed larger images this would have done better.  The 640 resolution doesn''t do it justice--at this size you have a moiré pattern interfering with viewing the smooth flowing pattern which I''ll bet is clear at full size.  <br/> <br/>Did you get any other "natural" shapes?  <br/></td>', 'Excellent catch of the heart shape!  Very cool.  I am sure if DPC allowed larger images this would have done better.  The 640 resolution doesn''t do it justice--at this size you have a moiré pattern interfering with viewing the smooth flowing pattern which I''ll bet is clear at full size.   Did you get any other "natural" shapes?  ', '2005-10-07 10:59:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1817893, 140587, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset and I love the color extremes, but agree that the contrast seems to be turned up a bit too much.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset and I love the color extremes, but agree that the contrast seems to be turned up a bit too much.', '2005-10-27 13:08:29.000000', NULL, 0),
