(2182983, 141260, 28261, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  The abstract nature is very appealing as is the symmetry of the crop.  Would personally like to see the images lines contrasted a bit more and some USM Sharpening to really make it pop out.  For some reason, the image makes me think of cold, stark, art, rather than the soft warmth of the current post processing.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  The abstract nature is very appealing as is the symmetry of the crop.  Would personally like to see the images lines contrasted a bit more and some USM Sharpening to really make it pop out.  For some reason, the image makes me think of cold, stark, art, rather than the soft warmth of the current post processing.', '2006-02-25 20:02:06.000000', NULL, 0),
